(2203211, 302691, 48560, '<td valign="top">I have seen this face before... very familiar... oh, the "Heart" challenge! JUSTIN! :) OK ok, some comments on the photo instead. I like it. Her eyes, they are simply mesmerizing. Like the way you cropped this, it''s a tight crop and well suited for this potrait. Good lighting too. To be nit-picky, I would have preferred if your silhoute is not reflected on her eyes. 9</td>', 'I have seen this face before... very familiar... oh, the "Heart" challenge! JUSTIN! :) OK ok, some comments on the photo instead. I like it. Her eyes, they are simply mesmerizing. Like the way you cropped this, it''s a tight crop and well suited for this potrait. Good lighting too. To be nit-picky, I would have preferred if your silhoute is not reflected on her eyes. 9', '2006-03-06 02:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
