(2203375, 302418, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, pretty good post processing with ample contrast. Softbox reflections are a little harsh but there isn''t too uch you can do about that. The eyes are worked well, just that I am missing some detail in the eye whites, they come over as "too clean" if you know what I mean. A few very small visible eye veins might have helped here, but all in all, very kewl!</td>', 'Beautiful model, pretty good post processing with ample contrast. Softbox reflections are a little harsh but there isn''t too uch you can do about that. The eyes are worked well, just that I am missing some detail in the eye whites, they come over as "too clean" if you know what I mean. A few very small visible eye veins might have helped here, but all in all, very kewl!', '2006-03-06 03:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2203385, 302558, 5728, '<td valign="top">Impressive portrait, your model has a very natural expression! The post processing is good. Far too many people over process their portraits and lose too much detail, especially in the eye whites. Here the skin detail and the detail in the eyes is top!</td>', 'Impressive portrait, your model has a very natural expression! The post processing is good. Far too many people over process their portraits and lose too much detail, especially in the eye whites. Here the skin detail and the detail in the eyes is top!', '2006-03-06 03:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2203386, 303152, 5728, '<td valign="top">Love the green tones, they work in well with the black background!</td>', 'Love the green tones, they work in well with the black background!', '2006-03-06 03:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2203387, 303556, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, the composition is fitting. Lighting set up is good with the sudden disruptions between light and shadow. Maybe a little harsh in some places, but otherwise good.</td>', 'Good idea, the composition is fitting. Lighting set up is good with the sudden disruptions between light and shadow. Maybe a little harsh in some places, but otherwise good.', '2006-03-06 03:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
