(2203857, 302876, 15204, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  It works very well with the square.  I like her expression with the hint of a smile.  Most of the expression is in the eyes, which are the focal point ofthe image.  The lighting is <i>almost</i> flat, but with a tiny, harsh shadow by her nose.  The light source seems small (on camera flash?) or too far away and a bit too harsh, judging by this little shadow and the small catchlights in her eyes.<br/> <br/>Very well done, though.  7 from me.</td>', 'Nice composition.  It works very well with the square.  I like her expression with the hint of a smile.  Most of the expression is in the eyes, which are the focal point ofthe image.  The lighting is almost flat, but with a tiny, harsh shadow by her nose.  The light source seems small (on camera flash?) or too far away and a bit too harsh, judging by this little shadow and the small catchlights in her eyes. Very well done, though.  7 from me.', '2006-03-06 08:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
