(2203939, 302785, 39144, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo. The colors are brilliant. The DOF seems a little odd, with one eye in sharp focus with lots of detail, and the other eye lacking. The catchlights in the eyes are also a bit distracting. You can definitely tell that this photo was taken outdoors. I would like to see more of the photo in focus, at least more of the face.</td>', 'Awesome photo. The colors are brilliant. The DOF seems a little odd, with one eye in sharp focus with lots of detail, and the other eye lacking. The catchlights in the eyes are also a bit distracting. You can definitely tell that this photo was taken outdoors. I would like to see more of the photo in focus, at least more of the face.', '2006-03-06 09:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2203940, 303272, 32133, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Cool framing too</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Cool framing too', '2006-03-06 09:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2203941, 303054, 15204, '<td valign="top">Cool concept.  I think a different angle and perspective could have worked better, especailly with the square crop.  I wonder if you could have gotten a lower angle and in a little tighter, so the subject would be lower in the frame and the church would be higher.  Nice exposure for the blue sky and the black angel and the snow.</td>', 'Cool concept.  I think a different angle and perspective could have worked better, especailly with the square crop.  I wonder if you could have gotten a lower angle and in a little tighter, so the subject would be lower in the frame and the church would be higher.  Nice exposure for the blue sky and the black angel and the snow.', '2006-03-06 09:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2203945, 301736, 39144, '<td valign="top">LOL. You used this photo one week too early! Needs a great DOF so that the entire flower is in focus.</td>', 'LOL. You used this photo one week too early! Needs a great DOF so that the entire flower is in focus.', '2006-03-06 09:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
