(2204114, 303520, 5885, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, great lighting. Crop works well for the image. Nice B&amp;W treatment. 10</td>', 'Interesting subject, great lighting. Crop works well for the image. Nice B&W treatment. 10', '2006-03-06 10:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
