(2204134, 302351, 5885, '<td valign="top">Not sure how well this will do. I''m sure you''re getting plenty of feedback for using the word FUCK as the primary subject. <br/> <br/>Interesting concept. Good lighting. I do believe this would have worked better with a deeper DoF so that the tears in the paper were in sharper focus. But, overall this is an interesting composition. Good luck!</td>', 'Not sure how well this will do. I''m sure you''re getting plenty of feedback for using the word FUCK as the primary subject.  Interesting concept. Good lighting. I do believe this would have worked better with a deeper DoF so that the tears in the paper were in sharper focus. But, overall this is an interesting composition. Good luck!', '2006-03-06 11:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204137, 303425, 5885, '<td valign="top">Nice detail</td>', 'Nice detail', '2006-03-06 11:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204142, 303270, 10858, '<td valign="top">Somehow this reminded me to the impossible triangle. So great lines and shapes, and I love the colour object in the corner among all the BW. The only issue is that the lines are not always continuous on the edges of the transparent dark rectangle. The subject shouts for accurate fitting.<br/> <br/>If I were a member and I could vote, it would be a 9.99 from me. :-) Good luck!</td>', 'Somehow this reminded me to the impossible triangle. So great lines and shapes, and I love the colour object in the corner among all the BW. The only issue is that the lines are not always continuous on the edges of the transparent dark rectangle. The subject shouts for accurate fitting. If I were a member and I could vote, it would be a 9.99 from me. :-) Good luck!', '2006-03-06 11:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
