(2204191, 302073, 20530, '<td valign="top">Cool, I''m writing a book about treasure hunting in Florida. I look for these everytime I go to the beach. Did you find this?<br/> <br/>The exposure is good. Nice and sharp. Good choice of background. The only thing that bothers me is how the cross is just enough askew to be slightly distracting. My inclination is that it would work better if it were either straight, or at a sharper angle.</td>', 'Cool, I''m writing a book about treasure hunting in Florida. I look for these everytime I go to the beach. Did you find this? The exposure is good. Nice and sharp. Good choice of background. The only thing that bothers me is how the cross is just enough askew to be slightly distracting. My inclination is that it would work better if it were either straight, or at a sharper angle.', '2006-03-06 11:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204198, 301937, 33232, '<td valign="top">I love his gaze.  The heavy border works well-nice shot.</td>', 'I love his gaze.  The heavy border works well-nice shot.', '2006-03-06 11:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204201, 302986, 20530, '<td valign="top">That''s bound to get some reaction. It definitely stirs some emotion in me. Compositionally: Lots of nice diagonals serve to emphasize the movement and unease created by the subjects. The pipe is a bit distracting and the rear foot of cat looks a little "chopped". However, it''s hard to criticise considering how difficult it must have been to get a cat and bird to pose. Color, exposure and focus are great.</td>', 'That''s bound to get some reaction. It definitely stirs some emotion in me. Compositionally: Lots of nice diagonals serve to emphasize the movement and unease created by the subjects. The pipe is a bit distracting and the rear foot of cat looks a little "chopped". However, it''s hard to criticise considering how difficult it must have been to get a cat and bird to pose. Color, exposure and focus are great.', '2006-03-06 11:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
