(2204617, 302308, 29827, '<td valign="top">Beautifully framed, but the focus lets it down.</td>', 'Beautifully framed, but the focus lets it down.', '2006-03-06 14:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204618, 303319, 35645, '<td valign="top">Great idea, beautiful colors and patterns.</td>', 'Great idea, beautiful colors and patterns.', '2006-03-06 14:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204626, 303028, 35645, '<td valign="top">This would score better with me if _either_ the squares on the board were lined up perpendicularly to the sides of the photo _or_ they were placed on a much steeper diagonal. As it stands, it simply looks a little sloppy. Also, a slightly lower angle would help give this more interest, and help isolate the pieces from the board.</td>', 'This would score better with me if _either_ the squares on the board were lined up perpendicularly to the sides of the photo _or_ they were placed on a much steeper diagonal. As it stands, it simply looks a little sloppy. Also, a slightly lower angle would help give this more interest, and help isolate the pieces from the board.', '2006-03-06 14:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204644, 303337, 35645, '<td valign="top">Not sure I care for the darkness of this. I wonder if this was inverted in post processing, since the centers of the flowers are lighter and the outer edges, and I don''t recall seeing orchids colored that way naturally. If that''s the case, I think that this would look much better un-inverted. If it''s not the case, I think that less processing would work better.</td>', 'Not sure I care for the darkness of this. I wonder if this was inverted in post processing, since the centers of the flowers are lighter and the outer edges, and I don''t recall seeing orchids colored that way naturally. If that''s the case, I think that this would look much better un-inverted. If it''s not the case, I think that less processing would work better.', '2006-03-06 14:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204645, 303054, 19944, '<td valign="top">Does she ever get tire of putting those wings on?  I hope not.  They do well for you.</td>', 'Does she ever get tire of putting those wings on?  I hope not.  They do well for you.', '2006-03-06 14:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204647, 302744, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Lovely symmetry. 8.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Lovely symmetry. 8.', '2006-03-06 14:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204651, 303160, 35645, '<td valign="top">Focus seems to be a hair off. I feel that the center of the flower should be crisper.</td>', 'Focus seems to be a hair off. I feel that the center of the flower should be crisper.', '2006-03-06 14:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204655, 303528, 35645, '<td valign="top">Um, ew? Seriously could have done without the ''yellow water''.</td>', 'Um, ew? Seriously could have done without the ''yellow water''.', '2006-03-06 14:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204656, 302497, 35645, '<td valign="top">Color is way overdone for my taste. Also, the focus doesn''t seem quite right.</td>', 'Color is way overdone for my taste. Also, the focus doesn''t seem quite right.', '2006-03-06 14:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204658, 301294, 35645, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. Love how the red glows.</td>', 'Nice abstract. Love how the red glows.', '2006-03-06 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204661, 303271, 35645, '<td valign="top">Great squirrel capture! Beautiful texture in the fur, great expression on the face, just a lovely pic. 8.</td>', 'Great squirrel capture! Beautiful texture in the fur, great expression on the face, just a lovely pic. 8.', '2006-03-06 14:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204664, 303262, 35645, '<td valign="top">I think that a different angle (head on to the car with the car centered in the arch) would have been much more visually pleasing.</td>', 'I think that a different angle (head on to the car with the car centered in the arch) would have been much more visually pleasing.', '2006-03-06 14:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204673, 303130, 19961, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, love the colours. Not enough of interest in the picture to push it to a top score. All imho obviously. Good luck!</td>', 'Very sharp, love the colours. Not enough of interest in the picture to push it to a top score. All imho obviously. Good luck!', '2006-03-06 14:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204678, 301666, 35645, '<td valign="top">Would be better had the right hand pole not been falling out of the picture. Throws the balance off, I think.</td>', 'Would be better had the right hand pole not been falling out of the picture. Throws the balance off, I think.', '2006-03-06 14:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204679, 301272, 31443, '<td valign="top">Interesting and a nice image to look at..</td>', 'Interesting and a nice image to look at..', '2006-03-06 14:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204682, 303434, 19961, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, love the colours. I would perhaps have left out the sky, now it becomes perhaps a bit too ordinary to get a top score. All imho obviously. Good luck!</td>', 'Very sharp, love the colours. I would perhaps have left out the sky, now it becomes perhaps a bit too ordinary to get a top score. All imho obviously. Good luck!', '2006-03-06 14:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204683, 302460, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and gorgeous skin tones, but the crop feels a little too tight. I think a slightly wider crop (even keeping it square) would work better as it wouldn''t feel so ''aggressive''.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and gorgeous skin tones, but the crop feels a little too tight. I think a slightly wider crop (even keeping it square) would work better as it wouldn''t feel so ''aggressive''.', '2006-03-06 14:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204684, 303443, 31443, '<td valign="top">I like this image, the rock in the ocean plays a big part in the overall look of the image, too bad about the burn top left..</td>', 'I like this image, the rock in the ocean plays a big part in the overall look of the image, too bad about the burn top left..', '2006-03-06 14:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204686, 303440, 19961, '<td valign="top">Cool, love the "colours". Not sure about the framing. All imho obviously. Good luck!</td>', 'Cool, love the "colours". Not sure about the framing. All imho obviously. Good luck!', '2006-03-06 14:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204691, 301422, 19961, '<td valign="top">Very sharp. Not enough "spark" in the picture to push it to a top score. All imho obviously. Good luck!</td>', 'Very sharp. Not enough "spark" in the picture to push it to a top score. All imho obviously. Good luck!', '2006-03-06 14:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204693, 301822, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, my only 10 of this challenge.  I like your choice sepia like tones for this photo, they work quite well.  Normally photos of children leave me rather uninspired, typically they are just trying to get by on cuteness.  Perhaps it is because the tones work so well with the sleeping child or because it has me thinking of my own daughter.  Either way you accomplished what a good photo should...to move someone in some special way!  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice photo, my only 10 of this challenge.  I like your choice sepia like tones for this photo, they work quite well.  Normally photos of children leave me rather uninspired, typically they are just trying to get by on cuteness.  Perhaps it is because the tones work so well with the sleeping child or because it has me thinking of my own daughter.  Either way you accomplished what a good photo should...to move someone in some special way!  Good luck.', '2006-03-06 14:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204695, 303021, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very nice, pleasant picture. Love the focus, good colors, very nice border treatment.</td>', 'Very nice, pleasant picture. Love the focus, good colors, very nice border treatment.', '2006-03-06 14:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204703, 303007, 19961, '<td valign="top">Things seems to be falling over.  Birds are very small, so does not add to the picture imo.  All imho obviously. Good luck!</td>', 'Things seems to be falling over.  Birds are very small, so does not add to the picture imo.  All imho obviously. Good luck!', '2006-03-06 14:55:40.000000', NULL, 1);
