(2204758, 303015, 41066, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this photograph for a while and whilst I love it, I think I would have preferred not to have the flowers in front of her face.  She is stunning and I would love to see this photograph with just her and maybe the flowers in the hair. 8 from me.</td>', 'I have looked at this photograph for a while and whilst I love it, I think I would have preferred not to have the flowers in front of her face.  She is stunning and I would love to see this photograph with just her and maybe the flowers in the hair. 8 from me.', '2006-03-06 15:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204764, 303079, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful stuff. Clever cropping which works, marvellous tonality, marvellous expression. No fan of simple portraits but this is, I think, special. Bravo.</td>', 'Wonderful stuff. Clever cropping which works, marvellous tonality, marvellous expression. No fan of simple portraits but this is, I think, special. Bravo.', '2006-03-06 15:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204772, 303335, 5664, '<td valign="top">Good idea buy to red skin tone .. ice</td>', 'Good idea buy to red skin tone .. ice', '2006-03-06 15:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204773, 303196, 6999, '<td valign="top">Kind of interesting to me, in a neo-epxressionist sort of way. Not necessarily my kind of thing, but one must make allowances for personal preferences. My real problem with it is that the square crop seems absolutely arbitrary to this composition.</td>', 'Kind of interesting to me, in a neo-epxressionist sort of way. Not necessarily my kind of thing, but one must make allowances for personal preferences. My real problem with it is that the square crop seems absolutely arbitrary to this composition.', '2006-03-06 15:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204776, 303216, 6999, '<td valign="top">As with a number of shots so far, the square crop seems entirely arbitrary to this composition. The image is nice enough, though not something i''d go very wild for - but to all intents and purposes this could have had any crop that maintained the silhouette framing of the lighthouse. It''s well done though, especially the depth of field.</td>', 'As with a number of shots so far, the square crop seems entirely arbitrary to this composition. The image is nice enough, though not something i''d go very wild for - but to all intents and purposes this could have had any crop that maintained the silhouette framing of the lighthouse. It''s well done though, especially the depth of field.', '2006-03-06 15:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2204778, 302766, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neatly done portrait - shows complete competence. Lacks any great spark of excitement for me, but a solid entry - unlikely to threaten the ribbons I fear, simply due to the subject matter.</td>', 'Neatly done portrait - shows complete competence. Lacks any great spark of excitement for me, but a solid entry - unlikely to threaten the ribbons I fear, simply due to the subject matter.', '2006-03-06 15:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
