(2204796, 303503, 43753, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting. There is so uch clor in her skin and hair. THe light looks really good on her shirt too. What an expression!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting. There is so uch clor in her skin and hair. THe light looks really good on her shirt too. What an expression!', '2006-03-06 15:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
