(2204809, 303348, 43753, '<td valign="top">I like the lines and colors in the background behind the dogs. There seems to be a slight blue halo around the dogs. Is that from sharpening maybe. I like the dogs being included in the frame.</td>', 'I like the lines and colors in the background behind the dogs. There seems to be a slight blue halo around the dogs. Is that from sharpening maybe. I like the dogs being included in the frame.', '2006-03-06 15:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
