(2204847, 301823, 43753, '<td valign="top">Ah, the curious nature of children. Great skin tones and colors throughout. There is a bit too much softening (noise reduction) in the hair and shirt.</td>', 'Ah, the curious nature of children. Great skin tones and colors throughout. There is a bit too much softening (noise reduction) in the hair and shirt.', '2006-03-06 15:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
