(2205069, 303028, 43753, '<td valign="top">Something abpit the image quality seems poor to me, like the focus is off or something. Maybe if this was shot at more of an angel with some shallow DOF.</td>', 'Something abpit the image quality seems poor to me, like the focus is off or something. Maybe if this was shot at more of an angel with some shallow DOF.', '2006-03-06 17:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
