(2205076, 303029, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very stylish. I love the entire compostion. THe sky is a beautiful burnt orange, and there is so much detail in the clouds. I really like the black border at the bottom.</td>', 'Very stylish. I love the entire compostion. THe sky is a beautiful burnt orange, and there is so much detail in the clouds. I really like the black border at the bottom.', '2006-03-06 17:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
