(2205114, 303370, 42100, '<td valign="top">The artful tilt really works well for this photo.  The dancers resemble an elegant flower, a lotus or orchid or somthing like that.  Excellent photograph!</td>', 'The artful tilt really works well for this photo.  The dancers resemble an elegant flower, a lotus or orchid or somthing like that.  Excellent photograph!', '2006-03-06 17:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
