(2205156, 303322, 33947, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting around the edges and top. The translucency is neat. Never seen anything like it. 6</td>', 'Like the lighting around the edges and top. The translucency is neat. Never seen anything like it. 6', '2006-03-06 17:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
