(2205160, 303550, 24454, '<td valign="top">There''s something so pretty about this.  I really like the soft muted look to this.  An appealing abstract kind of look.</td>', 'There''s something so pretty about this.  I really like the soft muted look to this.  An appealing abstract kind of look.', '2006-03-06 17:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205163, 303276, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great documentary style photograph. The toning works well and the choice for b&amp;w makes the viewer look at what''s going without being distracted by colors of shirts, pants and shoes. The underside looks a bit cut off, but it doesn''t hurt that much as the energy is in the upper part. 10</td>', 'Great documentary style photograph. The toning works well and the choice for b&w makes the viewer look at what''s going without being distracted by colors of shirts, pants and shoes. The underside looks a bit cut off, but it doesn''t hurt that much as the energy is in the upper part. 10', '2006-03-06 17:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205164, 302257, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very nice eye level pier shot. I feel like I''m standing right behind that first pillar. Like the repetitve lines created by the shadows. Good contrast. Neat composition. 6</td>', 'Very nice eye level pier shot. I feel like I''m standing right behind that first pillar. Like the repetitve lines created by the shadows. Good contrast. Neat composition. 6', '2006-03-06 17:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
