(2205166, 303019, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful!  I am so drawn to bridges.  They are so photogenic, and you have managed to find an especially beautiful one!  Outstanding richness and depth!  9</td>', 'This is just beautiful!  I am so drawn to bridges.  They are so photogenic, and you have managed to find an especially beautiful one!  Outstanding richness and depth!  9', '2006-03-06 17:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205167, 303314, 7810, '<td valign="top">Bang on for the challenge Very cool image very good use of the dof to sell the image Great work here</td>', 'Bang on for the challenge Very cool image very good use of the dof to sell the image Great work here', '2006-03-06 17:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205169, 303465, 7810, '<td valign="top">perfect for the challenge nice image great colours...makes me think of the dessert I am not supposed to eat  :)</td>', 'perfect for the challenge nice image great colours...makes me think of the dessert I am not supposed to eat  :)', '2006-03-06 17:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205171, 303055, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great idea and it has a good mood. The middle line is a bit centered, but the diaginal across the snow saves it. Maybe a lower camera setting, looking more upwards to the trees could work better.</td>', 'Great idea and it has a good mood. The middle line is a bit centered, but the diaginal across the snow saves it. Maybe a lower camera setting, looking more upwards to the trees could work better.', '2006-03-06 17:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205175, 303573, 6999, '<td valign="top">Surely, surely this would be better in a portrait crop? It has that dynamic, the diagonal line, and the depth of field to make a shot that would work like that. Entering it in this challenge is simply following the challenge rules, without framing an image to actually work in this quite difficult format.</td>', 'Surely, surely this would be better in a portrait crop? It has that dynamic, the diagonal line, and the depth of field to make a shot that would work like that. Entering it in this challenge is simply following the challenge rules, without framing an image to actually work in this quite difficult format.', '2006-03-06 17:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205179, 303091, 53806, '<td valign="top">this crop definitely works for your subject, very nice! :)</td>', 'this crop definitely works for your subject, very nice! :)', '2006-03-06 17:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205183, 303163, 49873, '<td valign="top">IMHO this is an example of an ordinary flower shot turned to a great one.</td>', 'IMHO this is an example of an ordinary flower shot turned to a great one.', '2006-03-06 17:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205184, 303314, 53806, '<td valign="top">your subject is very compelling. the only thing is that i wished the left side of this shot was more in focus...</td>', 'your subject is very compelling. the only thing is that i wished the left side of this shot was more in focus...', '2006-03-06 17:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205187, 302440, 29293, '<td valign="top">the coat at the bottom is distracting</td>', 'the coat at the bottom is distracting', '2006-03-06 17:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205188, 302251, 49873, '<td valign="top">I wish the driver side door was closed and there wasn''t another truck and some part of a man on the left side :) Other than that good shot.</td>', 'I wish the driver side door was closed and there wasn''t another truck and some part of a man on the left side :) Other than that good shot.', '2006-03-06 17:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205189, 303508, 29293, '<td valign="top">the horizon tilit doesnt work for me</td>', 'the horizon tilit doesnt work for me', '2006-03-06 17:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205191, 303216, 49873, '<td valign="top">Just wow.</td>', 'Just wow.', '2006-03-06 17:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205196, 303599, 49873, '<td valign="top">:) ha ha... great</td>', ':) ha ha... great', '2006-03-06 17:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205198, 303267, 29293, '<td valign="top">i wish his wing was not cut off</td>', 'i wish his wing was not cut off', '2006-03-06 17:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205199, 303607, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think you might usefully have used a monochrome conversion of this: that would have emphasised the graphic nature of the shot more strongly, and it''s those intersections of lines that make this shot, of course. I don''t find much colour here that would really not finction better as tonality in a black and white composition. However, it''s one of few shots so far that actually uses the compositional advantages of the square crop effectively, so you must be praised for that. Good, strong work.</td>', 'I think you might usefully have used a monochrome conversion of this: that would have emphasised the graphic nature of the shot more strongly, and it''s those intersections of lines that make this shot, of course. I don''t find much colour here that would really not finction better as tonality in a black and white composition. However, it''s one of few shots so far that actually uses the compositional advantages of the square crop effectively, so you must be praised for that. Good, strong work.', '2006-03-06 17:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205203, 302986, 29293, '<td valign="top">good moment!!!</td>', 'good moment!!!', '2006-03-06 17:59:55.000000', NULL, 1);
