(2205410, 301736, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lack of complete focus doesn''t seem to work for this shot - such a very graphic composition (whilst right for the square crop) really demands full focus, I think. Would love to see the colour a bit more punchy too - just has that slight washed-out over-exposed/underprocessed feel to it. Lacks a slight sense of extreme detail too.</td>', 'Lack of complete focus doesn''t seem to work for this shot - such a very graphic composition (whilst right for the square crop) really demands full focus, I think. Would love to see the colour a bit more punchy too - just has that slight washed-out over-exposed/underprocessed feel to it. Lacks a slight sense of extreme detail too.', '2006-03-06 18:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
