(2205772, 303354, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, and great clarity and colors.  The composition could be stronger.  Maybe by tilting a little and moving the main flower towards the upper corner.  It feels like the main flower is too centered and the surrounding flowers are chopped off.</td>', 'Very pretty, and great clarity and colors.  The composition could be stronger.  Maybe by tilting a little and moving the main flower towards the upper corner.  It feels like the main flower is too centered and the surrounding flowers are chopped off.', '2006-03-06 21:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205790, 303241, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very sweet!  IMO, it could use lots more contrast.  It is very middle gray throughout and lacks a good tonal range.  I would use levels to bring the shadows down and the highlights up.</td>', 'Very sweet!  IMO, it could use lots more contrast.  It is very middle gray throughout and lacks a good tonal range.  I would use levels to bring the shadows down and the highlights up.', '2006-03-06 21:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
