(2207261, 301819, 52790, '<td valign="top">this picture would be mazing with a intense clouds, because you had to slow the shutter speed to blur the water, you lost all detail in the sky, and thus lost this competition, using a grad grey filter or grad polorizer filter could have saved this image, go back some time right after a storm/or right before and look for intensity in the sky, capture both the flowing serenity of the water and the dark intensity of the sky and you have a winning photograph</td>', 'this picture would be mazing with a intense clouds, because you had to slow the shutter speed to blur the water, you lost all detail in the sky, and thus lost this competition, using a grad grey filter or grad polorizer filter could have saved this image, go back some time right after a storm/or right before and look for intensity in the sky, capture both the flowing serenity of the water and the dark intensity of the sky and you have a winning photograph', '2006-03-07 13:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207262, 302555, 52790, '<td valign="top">nice, but the vignetting didn''t work very well for me</td>', 'nice, but the vignetting didn''t work very well for me', '2006-03-07 13:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207263, 302944, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - it would be perfect if they were all looking at the camera.  8</td>', 'Beautiful shot - it would be perfect if they were all looking at the camera.  8', '2006-03-07 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207264, 303401, 52790, '<td valign="top">having more depth of field would have saved this image, because you chose such a wide aperature, probably with a macro lense-to get the detail in the icicle, you lost detail in the tongue, and that, to me, is essential</td>', 'having more depth of field would have saved this image, because you chose such a wide aperature, probably with a macro lense-to get the detail in the icicle, you lost detail in the tongue, and that, to me, is essential', '2006-03-07 13:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207267, 303459, 52790, '<td valign="top">okay okay, why don''t i like this image? my eye keeps dancing over the entire thing, and i can''t rest on the entire image, i think the black on the left, i am assuming some sort of rock formation, is why i don''t like it</td>', 'okay okay, why don''t i like this image? my eye keeps dancing over the entire thing, and i can''t rest on the entire image, i think the black on the left, i am assuming some sort of rock formation, is why i don''t like it', '2006-03-07 13:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207269, 302278, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done portrait.  Excellent lighting technique and the square crop really works well.  Having them both looking off in the same direction and highlighting the profiles adds that extra little bit of "oomph" that makes this something other than a standard portrait.  10</td>', 'Beautifully done portrait.  Excellent lighting technique and the square crop really works well.  Having them both looking off in the same direction and highlighting the profiles adds that extra little bit of "oomph" that makes this something other than a standard portrait.  10', '2006-03-07 13:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207272, 303413, 52790, '<td valign="top">a little light reflected in the left eye would have been nice</td>', 'a little light reflected in the left eye would have been nice', '2006-03-07 13:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207274, 303143, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro.  Good use of abstract lines to make a powerful composition.  I wouldn''t mind if the dark tones were a bit more in the "black" range instead of dark gray to really give it a bit more strength, but maybe that''s my monitor.  I like this very much.  9</td>', 'Very nice macro.  Good use of abstract lines to make a powerful composition.  I wouldn''t mind if the dark tones were a bit more in the "black" range instead of dark gray to really give it a bit more strength, but maybe that''s my monitor.  I like this very much.  9', '2006-03-07 13:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207276, 303389, 5391, '<td valign="top">Really interesting shot - you have to look twice to see that is ice.  If you cloned out the cracks in the ice and put the subject in summer clothing, you''d have a "walking on water" effect.  Really interesting.</td>', 'Really interesting shot - you have to look twice to see that is ice.  If you cloned out the cracks in the ice and put the subject in summer clothing, you''d have a "walking on water" effect.  Really interesting.', '2006-03-07 13:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207280, 303044, 47117, '<td valign="top">Brings back memories. I used to go there ALL the time when I lived in Rhode Island. Nice shot.</td>', 'Brings back memories. I used to go there ALL the time when I lived in Rhode Island. Nice shot.', '2006-03-07 13:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207282, 303019, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - very interesting light.  The symmetry of the reflections works well with the square crop, expecially with the stones in the front of the frame breaking it up a bit.  8</td>', 'Beautiful shot - very interesting light.  The symmetry of the reflections works well with the square crop, expecially with the stones in the front of the frame breaking it up a bit.  8', '2006-03-07 13:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207284, 303581, 52790, '<td valign="top">no impact, and no distinguished point of interest, i know the tree in the middle is centered, but all the other trees, which are underexposed, distract from it, and nothing about the center tree draws my eye in</td>', 'no impact, and no distinguished point of interest, i know the tree in the middle is centered, but all the other trees, which are underexposed, distract from it, and nothing about the center tree draws my eye in', '2006-03-07 13:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207287, 303074, 52790, '<td valign="top">i don''t understand the point of this image, the vase and the package of napkins don''t entirely go together, and it is slightly underexposed, i am not impressed</td>', 'i don''t understand the point of this image, the vase and the package of napkins don''t entirely go together, and it is slightly underexposed, i am not impressed', '2006-03-07 13:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207288, 302946, 5391, '<td valign="top">Captivating shot.  The subject''s connection with the camera draws the viewer in, and the background image adds mystery.  The lighting is absolutely perfect, right down to the catchlight in the eyes.  Artistic, one of the best of the challenge.  10</td>', 'Captivating shot.  The subject''s connection with the camera draws the viewer in, and the background image adds mystery.  The lighting is absolutely perfect, right down to the catchlight in the eyes.  Artistic, one of the best of the challenge.  10', '2006-03-07 13:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207293, 302497, 52790, '<td valign="top">gross gross gross, over edited image, looks fake (background does), i have been to the grand canyon, and this could have been done much better, i am very disappointed because you had an amazing sky to work with and you wasted it on this image, im not going to even talk about the subject...</td>', 'gross gross gross, over edited image, looks fake (background does), i have been to the grand canyon, and this could have been done much better, i am very disappointed because you had an amazing sky to work with and you wasted it on this image, im not going to even talk about the subject...', '2006-03-07 13:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207294, 303663, 52790, '<td valign="top">by far one of the best images in this competition, a breath of fresh air, i was getting so dissappointed with the other entries, best of luck</td>', 'by far one of the best images in this competition, a breath of fresh air, i was getting so dissappointed with the other entries, best of luck', '2006-03-07 13:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207295, 302618, 52790, '<td valign="top">great emotion, and almost great exposure, great ballance and composition, the sky is so bleak though, i do think it works because the child''s outfit is so bright, very good photograph</td>', 'great emotion, and almost great exposure, great ballance and composition, the sky is so bleak though, i do think it works because the child''s outfit is so bright, very good photograph', '2006-03-07 13:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207296, 303278, 52790, '<td valign="top">oversharpened</td>', 'oversharpened', '2006-03-07 13:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207298, 302785, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful portrait.  The clear sharpness of the eyes mixed with the softness and the vibrant color balance between the shirt and the face painting really makes this stand out.  The reflections in the eyes are a minor touch distracting, but this is one to be proud of.  Great job!  9</td>', 'Very beautiful portrait.  The clear sharpness of the eyes mixed with the softness and the vibrant color balance between the shirt and the face painting really makes this stand out.  The reflections in the eyes are a minor touch distracting, but this is one to be proud of.  Great job!  9', '2006-03-07 13:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207299, 303260, 52790, '<td valign="top">boring and ugly, nice light though</td>', 'boring and ugly, nice light though', '2006-03-07 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207302, 303426, 43405, '<td valign="top">Top Notch photograph. Like the contrast and focus is tack sharp. Well done</td>', 'Top Notch photograph. Like the contrast and focus is tack sharp. Well done', '2006-03-07 13:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207304, 302351, 5391, '<td valign="top">Well done shot, makes a statement.  If it wasn''t for the profanity it would make an excellent shock shot.  8</td>', 'Well done shot, makes a statement.  If it wasn''t for the profanity it would make an excellent shock shot.  8', '2006-03-07 13:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207305, 302838, 52790, '<td valign="top">flat, please work on your exposure when doing black and white work. suggestion: instead of desaturating the image, go into your channel mixer, convert to monochromatic, and then change the Red and Blue to 0% and leave the green at 100%, notice the difference?</td>', 'flat, please work on your exposure when doing black and white work. suggestion: instead of desaturating the image, go into your channel mixer, convert to monochromatic, and then change the Red and Blue to 0% and leave the green at 100%, notice the difference?', '2006-03-07 13:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207306, 303573, 52790, '<td valign="top">decent image</td>', 'decent image', '2006-03-07 13:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207307, 302783, 52790, '<td valign="top">pretty average photograph, a sunset/sunrise in the background would have made it work, but it is too bleak</td>', 'pretty average photograph, a sunset/sunrise in the background would have made it work, but it is too bleak', '2006-03-07 13:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207308, 303284, 52790, '<td valign="top">okay...and the point is? at least get your picture in focus!</td>', 'okay...and the point is? at least get your picture in focus!', '2006-03-07 13:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207309, 302418, 5391, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful portrait.  Excellent lighting.  The colors are captivating.  10</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful portrait.  Excellent lighting.  The colors are captivating.  10', '2006-03-07 13:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207310, 302119, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is a pet portrait to be proud of.  Works excellently with the square format and the lighting is beautiful.  10</td>', 'This is a pet portrait to be proud of.  Works excellently with the square format and the lighting is beautiful.  10', '2006-03-07 13:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
