(2207320, 303520, 5391, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, great personality.  The little whisp of smoke combined with such a fantastic character makes for a superbly interesting shot.  I could look at this all day - it makes you want to ask the subject about himself.  10</td>', 'Great lighting, great personality.  The little whisp of smoke combined with such a fantastic character makes for a superbly interesting shot.  I could look at this all day - it makes you want to ask the subject about himself.  10', '2006-03-07 13:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
