(2207331, 303406, 19944, '<td valign="top">All lighthouses get a bonus point from me.  This is a  really nice shot.  I know it''s a square crop challenge, but I''m just not sure the square crop works well for Portland Head.  Did you go down on the rocky beach below where you were standing for this shot.  It''s a great angle.</td>', 'All lighthouses get a bonus point from me.  This is a  really nice shot.  I know it''s a square crop challenge, but I''m just not sure the square crop works well for Portland Head.  Did you go down on the rocky beach below where you were standing for this shot.  It''s a great angle.', '2006-03-07 13:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
