(2207655, 303646, 19961, '<td valign="top">This just does not look very good, not an interesting subject nad it looks way overprocessed.</td>', 'This just does not look very good, not an interesting subject nad it looks way overprocessed.', '2006-03-07 15:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207658, 302449, 19961, '<td valign="top">Technically this looks terrible and I don''t care for the picture either.  Time to buy a book on photography?</td>', 'Technically this looks terrible and I don''t care for the picture either.  Time to buy a book on photography?', '2006-03-07 15:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207661, 303447, 19961, '<td valign="top">Technically this isn''t very good, a bit blurry and the colours seems off.  I''m also not very happy with the subject, I guess I just don''t get it (it there is anything to get?).</td>', 'Technically this isn''t very good, a bit blurry and the colours seems off.  I''m also not very happy with the subject, I guess I just don''t get it (it there is anything to get?).', '2006-03-07 15:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207662, 303644, 19961, '<td valign="top">Sorry, not fond of flagwaving.</td>', 'Sorry, not fond of flagwaving.', '2006-03-07 15:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207671, 302611, 19961, '<td valign="top">I love this! Cute babys aside she has a wonderful expression and the crop works for this one.  My top scoring picture.</td>', 'I love this! Cute babys aside she has a wonderful expression and the crop works for this one.  My top scoring picture.', '2006-03-07 15:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207678, 301001, 19961, '<td valign="top">I love this. Phalluses wants to be free! Very sharp, nice rendering of out of focus areas, good use of the crop. One of my top scores.</td>', 'I love this. Phalluses wants to be free! Very sharp, nice rendering of out of focus areas, good use of the crop. One of my top scores.', '2006-03-07 15:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207679, 303022, 19961, '<td valign="top">Sweet :).  Good use of the crop, processing works for this picture.  Good job!</td>', 'Sweet :).  Good use of the crop, processing works for this picture.  Good job!', '2006-03-07 15:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207681, 303066, 19961, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  Can I marry them please? :)  Very creative use of the crop, lovely models and the BW work very well here. Good job!</td>', 'I love this picture.  Can I marry them please? :)  Very creative use of the crop, lovely models and the BW work very well here. Good job!', '2006-03-07 15:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207686, 302418, 19961, '<td valign="top">Nice glow. Not so sure about the background colour though? Love the eyes and the hair. And a very good looking model too :) The crop works very well here.<br/>Good job!</td>', 'Nice glow. Not so sure about the background colour though? Love the eyes and the hair. And a very good looking model too :) The crop works very well here.Good job!', '2006-03-07 15:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207687, 303629, 19961, '<td valign="top">Very nice, funny and scary at the same time. Good job! All imho obviously. Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice, funny and scary at the same time. Good job! All imho obviously. Good luck!', '2006-03-07 15:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207689, 303152, 19961, '<td valign="top">Good use of the crop and teh shallow dof. Lovely model too ;) Good job!</td>', 'Good use of the crop and teh shallow dof. Lovely model too ;) Good job!', '2006-03-07 15:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207690, 303558, 19961, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, love the colours. Not enough of interest in the picture to push it to a top score. All imho obviously. Good luck!</td>', 'Nice texture, love the colours. Not enough of interest in the picture to push it to a top score. All imho obviously. Good luck!', '2006-03-07 15:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207697, 303276, 19961, '<td valign="top">Like the way you convey the energy and agression in this picture.  I''m not quite sure about the crop?  The lower part is not that interesting perhaps?<br/>Good job even so!</td>', 'Like the way you convey the energy and agression in this picture.  I''m not quite sure about the crop?  The lower part is not that interesting perhaps?Good job even so!', '2006-03-07 15:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207700, 303543, 19961, '<td valign="top">I''m hungry already!  Like the use of the crop and the composition. Good job!</td>', 'I''m hungry already!  Like the use of the crop and the composition. Good job!', '2006-03-07 15:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207702, 302560, 43405, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Colour is fantastic. Nice focus too.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Colour is fantastic. Nice focus too.', '2006-03-07 15:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207703, 302278, 19961, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good colours, good job on the crop.</td>', 'Very nice. Good colours, good job on the crop.', '2006-03-07 15:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207709, 302946, 19961, '<td valign="top">I like this, I think you model save the day here, he has an interesting face and a good expression. Not quite sure on the background, but I might be missing the joke here? Good job!</td>', 'I like this, I think you model save the day here, he has an interesting face and a good expression. Not quite sure on the background, but I might be missing the joke here? Good job!', '2006-03-07 15:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207713, 303314, 19961, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallow dof and the crop. Very good colours, basically technically perfect. Good job!</td>', 'Good use of shallow dof and the crop. Very good colours, basically technically perfect. Good job!', '2006-03-07 15:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207718, 302305, 19961, '<td valign="top">I like the way this conveys fragility (at least it does to me).</td>', 'I like the way this conveys fragility (at least it does to me).', '2006-03-07 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207719, 303682, 43753, '<td valign="top">Beuatiful soft composition. I really like the blur in the background, and the blue/purple tones are wonderful.</td>', 'Beuatiful soft composition. I really like the blur in the background, and the blue/purple tones are wonderful.', '2006-03-07 15:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207728, 303019, 43405, '<td valign="top">Got a feeling this will be a top ten finisher, Very nice. Sharp and well edited.</td>', 'Got a feeling this will be a top ten finisher, Very nice. Sharp and well edited.', '2006-03-07 15:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207729, 303276, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great details. Nice framing. I like the frozen movement - very nice. The only peeve is the person at the bottom of the frame. I wish I could see more or less of him. As is, he is not a part of the image, but he is there - a distraction.</td>', 'Great details. Nice framing. I like the frozen movement - very nice. The only peeve is the person at the bottom of the frame. I wish I could see more or less of him. As is, he is not a part of the image, but he is there - a distraction.', '2006-03-07 15:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207731, 303595, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice textures. Perfect title for image. Lots of contrast and shadows too. Well done.</td>', 'Nice textures. Perfect title for image. Lots of contrast and shadows too. Well done.', '2006-03-07 15:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207737, 303272, 43753, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro - so much detail. I love the colors and how you tied the green into your framing. Excellent work!!</td>', 'Excellent macro - so much detail. I love the colors and how you tied the green into your framing. Excellent work!!', '2006-03-07 15:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207739, 303113, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice and graceful with lots of details in the feathers. Great job!!</td>', 'Nice and graceful with lots of details in the feathers. Great job!!', '2006-03-07 15:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207743, 303270, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great set up and composition. I lvoe all the lines and shapes, as well as the colors!! Way to go!!</td>', 'Great set up and composition. I lvoe all the lines and shapes, as well as the colors!! Way to go!!', '2006-03-07 15:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207746, 303206, 43753, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and you see some nice detail in the tail feathers and feathers on the breast. The fovus is a little soft around the beak.</td>', 'I like the composition, and you see some nice detail in the tail feathers and feathers on the breast. The fovus is a little soft around the beak.', '2006-03-07 15:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207748, 303244, 21915, '<td valign="top">The first shot I get to vote on in this challenge and it''s a ten all the way. Love the detail of the feathers</td>', 'The first shot I get to vote on in this challenge and it''s a ten all the way. Love the detail of the feathers', '2006-03-07 15:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207750, 302577, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great tones! Your lighting is very flattering, ads the perfect amount of highlights to the face. Very crisp composition.</td>', 'Great tones! Your lighting is very flattering, ads the perfect amount of highlights to the face. Very crisp composition.', '2006-03-07 15:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207752, 302775, 43753, '<td valign="top">Beautiful symmetry. I really like the amount of detail you have presented. Great exposure too!</td>', 'Beautiful symmetry. I really like the amount of detail you have presented. Great exposure too!', '2006-03-07 15:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207757, 303500, 43753, '<td valign="top">The positioning of your subjects within the frame is perfectly balanced. The focus is a little soft atoud the ball and fooy &amp; habd of the player on the right of the frame. I know they are moving fast. I love the concentration you captured in the faces. Here you''re focus is dead on, and this is where it counts I think. Good job!!</td>', 'The positioning of your subjects within the frame is perfectly balanced. The focus is a little soft atoud the ball and fooy & habd of the player on the right of the frame. I know they are moving fast. I love the concentration you captured in the faces. Here you''re focus is dead on, and this is where it counts I think. Good job!!', '2006-03-07 15:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207761, 303403, 21915, '<td valign="top">Well done to find this shot its great :)</td>', 'Well done to find this shot its great :)', '2006-03-07 15:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207770, 303551, 43753, '<td valign="top">I do love the colors here. The textures are nice, and the background is even. The background is busy enough (not in a bad way), so I think I would have moved the two branches in the foreground. I think moving closer and around one of the blooms (so the other bloom is off-center behind the other) might make the composition a little stronge. As is, there isn''t a lot of dimension to the composition.</td>', 'I do love the colors here. The textures are nice, and the background is even. The background is busy enough (not in a bad way), so I think I would have moved the two branches in the foreground. I think moving closer and around one of the blooms (so the other bloom is off-center behind the other) might make the composition a little stronge. As is, there isn''t a lot of dimension to the composition.', '2006-03-07 16:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207772, 303520, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice dark portrait. Looks rough like the subject. THe B&amp;W really brings out the details in the beard and wrinkles in the face.</td>', 'Nice dark portrait. Looks rough like the subject. THe B&W really brings out the details in the beard and wrinkles in the face.', '2006-03-07 16:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207775, 302525, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. You have a lot of sharp detail, which really makes the image grab your attention.</td>', 'Nice composition. You have a lot of sharp detail, which really makes the image grab your attention.', '2006-03-07 16:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207780, 302352, 43753, '<td valign="top">Just a little more DOF to put those front buttons into focus. Love the angle and colors. I think I might have run a damp cloth over the surface, just to clean up some of that grit.</td>', 'Just a little more DOF to put those front buttons into focus. Love the angle and colors. I think I might have run a damp cloth over the surface, just to clean up some of that grit.', '2006-03-07 16:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207785, 302691, 43753, '<td valign="top">Beuatiful skin tones and details in the face. The eyes are beautiful, but the reflections are a little busy. Her mascera is a little clumpy too. Beautiful lighting on the face, especially on the cheeks.</td>', 'Beuatiful skin tones and details in the face. The eyes are beautiful, but the reflections are a little busy. Her mascera is a little clumpy too. Beautiful lighting on the face, especially on the cheeks.', '2006-03-07 16:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207790, 302073, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very interseting and historical object. I like the color and the black background.</td>', 'Very interseting and historical object. I like the color and the black background.', '2006-03-07 16:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207795, 303341, 21915, '<td valign="top">This looks so much like the English Lake Disrict, forgive me if I''m wrong. Maybe a boost to the colours would work here well</td>', 'This looks so much like the English Lake Disrict, forgive me if I''m wrong. Maybe a boost to the colours would work here well', '2006-03-07 16:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207800, 303155, 43753, '<td valign="top">This is a tough type of shot to expose properly. You want to preserve the details in the buildings without overexposing the lights. The boats in front are just too distracting.</td>', 'This is a tough type of shot to expose properly. You want to preserve the details in the buildings without overexposing the lights. The boats in front are just too distracting.', '2006-03-07 16:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207801, 303342, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and flow through the image. I like the green color breaking up the neutral tones.</td>', 'Great DOF and flow through the image. I like the green color breaking up the neutral tones.', '2006-03-07 16:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207806, 302766, 43753, '<td valign="top">Beautiful boy! Look at those eye, so full of life and wonder. Everything is fresh and exciting at this age. I love the tones and smooth texture on the skin. Beautiful eyes!!</td>', 'Beautiful boy! Look at those eye, so full of life and wonder. Everything is fresh and exciting at this age. I love the tones and smooth texture on the skin. Beautiful eyes!!', '2006-03-07 16:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207811, 303388, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Great use of texture in the wall and clouds in the sky. i can''t say enough about the cat - this alone makes the composition really stand out. Excellent work!</td>', 'Great composition. Great use of texture in the wall and clouds in the sky. i can''t say enough about the cat - this alone makes the composition really stand out. Excellent work!', '2006-03-07 16:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207813, 303535, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and textures, great title. I like the perspective.</td>', 'Nice colors and textures, great title. I like the perspective.', '2006-03-07 16:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207818, 303007, 43753, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and exposure, but the distortion is a little distracting. I think that you might make up for that if you could shoot from more of an angle, or rotate your image some. Very nice details though - especially the birds.</td>', 'I really like the colors and exposure, but the distortion is a little distracting. I think that you might make up for that if you could shoot from more of an angle, or rotate your image some. Very nice details though - especially the birds.', '2006-03-07 16:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207822, 303049, 43753, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a line of pregnant women. Very graceful curves. I like the pattern and DOF. Nice the way the light plays here making the highlights and shadows bring out the curves.</td>', 'Almost looks like a line of pregnant women. Very graceful curves. I like the pattern and DOF. Nice the way the light plays here making the highlights and shadows bring out the curves.', '2006-03-07 16:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207834, 303276, 21915, '<td valign="top">Your talent shines through this shot. Great work. Engery, power music and youth 10</td>', 'Your talent shines through this shot. Great work. Engery, power music and youth 10', '2006-03-07 16:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207851, 303118, 21915, '<td valign="top">Love the expression on his face. This guy has guts. Great shot 10</td>', 'Love the expression on his face. This guy has guts. Great shot 10', '2006-03-07 16:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207868, 303091, 48228, '<td valign="top">Nice and colorful, and this would have done really well, in the "Master of Disguise" challenge.....</td>', 'Nice and colorful, and this would have done really well, in the "Master of Disguise" challenge.....', '2006-03-07 16:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207880, 303566, 48228, '<td valign="top">Magical....."WOW" I really love the sim;picity of the way you have taken this.....So well done.....Love it.....and give you a "10".</td>', 'Magical....."WOW" I really love the sim;picity of the way you have taken this.....So well done.....Love it.....and give you a "10".', '2006-03-07 16:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207889, 302351, 21915, '<td valign="top">You said it ! 9</td>', 'You said it ! 9', '2006-03-07 16:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207895, 302575, 21915, '<td valign="top">Love it</td>', 'Love it', '2006-03-07 16:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207897, 303029, 21915, '<td valign="top">Different I like it a lot 8</td>', 'Different I like it a lot 8', '2006-03-07 16:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207906, 303276, 33652, '<td valign="top">I really really like this and the square crop great as the energy is bursting out of the proverbial box!</td>', 'I really really like this and the square crop great as the energy is bursting out of the proverbial box!', '2006-03-07 16:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207913, 303398, 33652, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours and texture. love love love it!</td>', 'Wonderful colours and texture. love love love it!', '2006-03-07 16:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207915, 302528, 33652, '<td valign="top">Like the delicacy and softness. i can almost feel the gentle breeze.</td>', 'Like the delicacy and softness. i can almost feel the gentle breeze.', '2006-03-07 16:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207917, 303669, 33652, '<td valign="top">very nice abstract - suits square well</td>', 'very nice abstract - suits square well', '2006-03-07 16:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207918, 303452, 33652, '<td valign="top">v creative</td>', 'v creative', '2006-03-07 16:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207921, 302577, 33652, '<td valign="top">nice portrait - suits the square well</td>', 'nice portrait - suits the square well', '2006-03-07 16:47:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2207923, 303485, 6999, '<td valign="top">Technicaly pretty assured, though i would have the flash far softer a light than this - its produced heavy strange shadows, and some glare on her forehead and around the eye: I''m not asking for over the top airbrush flattery, but just a smoother, more realistic light. Love the situation though, neatly seen and shot.</td>', 'Technicaly pretty assured, though i would have the flash far softer a light than this - its produced heavy strange shadows, and some glare on her forehead and around the eye: I''m not asking for over the top airbrush flattery, but just a smoother, more realistic light. Love the situation though, neatly seen and shot.', '2006-03-07 16:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207925, 303216, 33652, '<td valign="top">well seen - love the framing</td>', 'well seen - love the framing', '2006-03-07 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207928, 301986, 6999, '<td valign="top">Red is so tricky in internet land - just doesn''t reproduce well: there''s such a fine line between saturation and clipping, and there''s always noise. That just adds a strange element to a strange enough photograph already; not sure what I make of it really.</td>', 'Red is so tricky in internet land - just doesn''t reproduce well: there''s such a fine line between saturation and clipping, and there''s always noise. That just adds a strange element to a strange enough photograph already; not sure what I make of it really.', '2006-03-07 16:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207929, 301729, 33652, '<td valign="top">striking abstract! nice work</td>', 'striking abstract! nice work', '2006-03-07 16:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207931, 303128, 6999, '<td valign="top">Has a certain strangth of dynamism and evident movement, though it feels constricted by the square crop requirement - it feels rather that you''ve forced the image into the format than that the image itself needed to be presented in this way. The flash seems too direct also - takes away much sense of depth from the photo.</td>', 'Has a certain strangth of dynamism and evident movement, though it feels constricted by the square crop requirement - it feels rather that you''ve forced the image into the format than that the image itself needed to be presented in this way. The flash seems too direct also - takes away much sense of depth from the photo.', '2006-03-07 16:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207934, 303350, 33652, '<td valign="top">nice leading lines</td>', 'nice leading lines', '2006-03-07 16:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207936, 301272, 33652, '<td valign="top">the soft tone is very pleasing</td>', 'the soft tone is very pleasing', '2006-03-07 16:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207937, 303564, 33652, '<td valign="top">this has a very immersive quality - very nice work!</td>', 'this has a very immersive quality - very nice work!', '2006-03-07 16:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207938, 303139, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst the purple shade is well reproduced, the yellow of the stamens looks dull and flattenend. Works fairly well for the crop, but not particularly strong composition; perhaps the light is just too ambient, lacking any sense of direction and therefore not helping to communicate shape and texture much.</td>', 'Whilst the purple shade is well reproduced, the yellow of the stamens looks dull and flattenend. Works fairly well for the crop, but not particularly strong composition; perhaps the light is just too ambient, lacking any sense of direction and therefore not helping to communicate shape and texture much.', '2006-03-07 16:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207939, 302946, 33652, '<td valign="top">really like the composition, darks and lights... v nice work</td>', 'really like the composition, darks and lights... v nice work', '2006-03-07 16:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207941, 302489, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  Certainly invokes a wide range of thoughts/feelings.  Interesting techniques used in both image and processing.  Very well done!</td>', 'Very interesting image.  Certainly invokes a wide range of thoughts/feelings.  Interesting techniques used in both image and processing.  Very well done!', '2006-03-07 16:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207943, 303498, 33652, '<td valign="top">hehe! way to meet a challenge! very cool! nice technical aspects too!</td>', 'hehe! way to meet a challenge! very cool! nice technical aspects too!', '2006-03-07 16:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207944, 303091, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very nice - both black and white seems slight overkill in your framing, I think. For the image itself, the colour repro seems excellent, and the detailing is strong and well executed. I like how we see a patch of real flesh, and the mess of the pancake make-up. Fun shot, and well done indeed.</td>', 'Very nice - both black and white seems slight overkill in your framing, I think. For the image itself, the colour repro seems excellent, and the detailing is strong and well executed. I like how we see a patch of real flesh, and the mess of the pancake make-up. Fun shot, and well done indeed.', '2006-03-07 16:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207947, 302365, 33652, '<td valign="top">lovely candid</td>', 'lovely candid', '2006-03-07 16:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207949, 303359, 37719, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing.  I like just the hint of crease in the forehead, eyes, cheek as opposed to emphasizing it.</td>', 'Interesting processing.  I like just the hint of crease in the forehead, eyes, cheek as opposed to emphasizing it.', '2006-03-07 16:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207950, 303073, 33652, '<td valign="top">good use of DOF to make art of something simple!</td>', 'good use of DOF to make art of something simple!', '2006-03-07 16:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207951, 302558, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great lighting - very nicely executed. Strong use of the compositional restrictions of this format too, and fine detail and all the rest is there. I would wish the eye reflections of your big softlight weren'';t directly over her pupils - gives the weirest sense of her being blind to me - eyes need that depth of black in the pupil to carry their message, and only the slightest change of angle would move that reflection to somewhere more appealing. I''ll be intrigued to see how far that affects your score - how far people really notice, and how far people subconsciously notice.</td>', 'Great lighting - very nicely executed. Strong use of the compositional restrictions of this format too, and fine detail and all the rest is there. I would wish the eye reflections of your big softlight weren'';t directly over her pupils - gives the weirest sense of her being blind to me - eyes need that depth of black in the pupil to carry their message, and only the slightest change of angle would move that reflection to somewhere more appealing. I''ll be intrigued to see how far that affects your score - how far people really notice, and how far people subconsciously notice.', '2006-03-07 16:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207954, 303329, 37719, '<td valign="top">Nice photo...doesn''t look anything like the Robins around here.  I like how the DoF is short enough to allow just the face in focus.  With the detail in the feathers the fade to the back is quite nice.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice photo...doesn''t look anything like the Robins around here.  I like how the DoF is short enough to allow just the face in focus.  With the detail in the feathers the fade to the back is quite nice.  Well done!', '2006-03-07 16:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207956, 303500, 33652, '<td valign="top">Great energy! This really works well in the square crop. Nice work.</td>', 'Great energy! This really works well in the square crop. Nice work.', '2006-03-07 16:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2207958, 303267, 37719, '<td valign="top">The crop is just a bit too close on the left.  The area that appears in focus seems to be the stomach...a bit distracting.</td>', 'The crop is just a bit too close on the left.  The area that appears in focus seems to be the stomach...a bit distracting.', '2006-03-07 17:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
