(2208240, 303540, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is great. A difficult challenge you''ve set yourself, but effectively done. A couple of minor criticisms: especially in that central area, your processing has taken things, for me, too far toward the graphic and away from the <i>photo</i>graphic - it''s become more like a simple plain of colours. The large field of red that surrounds it, nicely broken up by those water drops, is tremendously effective though. Overall, I would wish it looked more like a photograph and less like an illustration, but there''s a huge amount of good things going on - not least your thorough understanding of the imperatives of this aspect ratio. Well done.</td>', 'This is great. A difficult challenge you''ve set yourself, but effectively done. A couple of minor criticisms: especially in that central area, your processing has taken things, for me, too far toward the graphic and away from the photographic - it''s become more like a simple plain of colours. The large field of red that surrounds it, nicely broken up by those water drops, is tremendously effective though. Overall, I would wish it looked more like a photograph and less like an illustration, but there''s a huge amount of good things going on - not least your thorough understanding of the imperatives of this aspect ratio. Well done.', '2006-03-07 18:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2208241, 302775, 40797, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely BEAUTIFUL! Perfectly Centered!</td>', 'This is absolutely BEAUTIFUL! Perfectly Centered!', '2006-03-07 18:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2208245, 303066, 53806, '<td valign="top">the square crop is very fitting here, and i really like how all the women have that similar piercing expresssion. the only thing constructive i can say is the way they are lit. the woman on the top right (notice harsh shadow differences) has a lot less lighting than the girl to the bottom, for example. if all of them had more of a flattering lighting, maybe it would make it more powerful. perhaps using some reflectors to reflect the light where you want it can help. but overall, its a very compelling shot in my opinion :)</td>', 'the square crop is very fitting here, and i really like how all the women have that similar piercing expresssion. the only thing constructive i can say is the way they are lit. the woman on the top right (notice harsh shadow differences) has a lot less lighting than the girl to the bottom, for example. if all of them had more of a flattering lighting, maybe it would make it more powerful. perhaps using some reflectors to reflect the light where you want it can help. but overall, its a very compelling shot in my opinion :)', '2006-03-07 18:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2208248, 302471, 13547, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this type of picture before, but this is still a good idea!  It''s a pity her right hand didn''t extend all the way down to the bottom, but well done! 7</td>', 'I''ve seen this type of picture before, but this is still a good idea!  It''s a pity her right hand didn''t extend all the way down to the bottom, but well done! 7', '2006-03-07 18:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
