(2208264, 303425, 53806, '<td valign="top">i love the detail in the iris...the only thing i can suggest is that the slightly overexposed white area to the left can be a little distracting b/c its so harsh. i also wished that the tips of the eyelashes could had been more in focus. other than that, this shot really draws one''s attention, good job :)</td>', 'i love the detail in the iris...the only thing i can suggest is that the slightly overexposed white area to the left can be a little distracting b/c its so harsh. i also wished that the tips of the eyelashes could had been more in focus. other than that, this shot really draws one''s attention, good job :)', '2006-03-07 18:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
