(2208343, 302574, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice but not brilliant. The half and half sky to land ratio doesn''t sit to well with me. I would have preferred either a lot more of the dramatic sky or something in the foreground and less sky. As it is it feels neither one nor the other.</td>', 'Nice but not brilliant. The half and half sky to land ratio doesn''t sit to well with me. I would have preferred either a lot more of the dramatic sky or something in the foreground and less sky. As it is it feels neither one nor the other.', '2006-03-07 18:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
