(2208350, 303597, 5354, '<td valign="top">To get a good score with a flower shot it has to be exceptional, and sadly this one isn''t. It needs to be pin sharp all the way through and that needs gallons of light to get a good small apperture. The dof falls off too quickly in this image and has a slightly distracting background - white bits.</td>', 'To get a good score with a flower shot it has to be exceptional, and sadly this one isn''t. It needs to be pin sharp all the way through and that needs gallons of light to get a good small apperture. The dof falls off too quickly in this image and has a slightly distracting background - white bits.', '2006-03-07 18:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2208351, 303592, 5354, '<td valign="top">Difficult to comment on this except to say it doesn''t really have anything to keep the viewer looking at it for more than a few seconds. I wonder if it was better in colour?</td>', 'Difficult to comment on this except to say it doesn''t really have anything to keep the viewer looking at it for more than a few seconds. I wonder if it was better in colour?', '2006-03-07 18:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
