(2208887, 302803, 39144, '<td valign="top">Cool fish. They are fun to have. The photo is a bit plain though. Lighting is always one of the first things I see, and what sways my voting one way or the other. The other technical aspects of the photo are well done, but just work on the lighting. Both in-camera and during PP.</td>', 'Cool fish. They are fun to have. The photo is a bit plain though. Lighting is always one of the first things I see, and what sways my voting one way or the other. The other technical aspects of the photo are well done, but just work on the lighting. Both in-camera and during PP.', '2006-03-07 21:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2208888, 302283, 37524, '<td valign="top">Love the texture of the leaves.</td>', 'Love the texture of the leaves.', '2006-03-07 21:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2208895, 303345, 39144, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is about this shot, but I like it. However, it does look a bit fake with the crisp ripples in the water, yet a night shot look, which would lead me to believe it was a longer exposure. And the clouds add to the disbelief. Was it actually taken during the day, with a filter on the camera, of a filter added during PP?</td>', 'I don''t know what it is about this shot, but I like it. However, it does look a bit fake with the crisp ripples in the water, yet a night shot look, which would lead me to believe it was a longer exposure. And the clouds add to the disbelief. Was it actually taken during the day, with a filter on the camera, of a filter added during PP?', '2006-03-07 21:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2208897, 303360, 25270, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; fits challenge theme well.</td>', 'Nice composition; fits challenge theme well.', '2006-03-07 21:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
