(2208902, 303528, 39144, '<td valign="top">Gross. Disgusting. Humor? And on a technical note, the falloff of lighting on the top 1/4 of the photo leaves much to be desired.</td>', 'Gross. Disgusting. Humor? And on a technical note, the falloff of lighting on the top 1/4 of the photo leaves much to be desired.', '2006-03-07 21:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
