(2208986, 302986, 25355, '<td valign="top">Fantastic picture, Rikki. ;-) I like how the cat is in mid-stride. The pigeon seems still alive (was it?). Come to think of it, I never realised cats went for pigeons.</td>', 'Fantastic picture, Rikki. ;-) I like how the cat is in mid-stride. The pigeon seems still alive (was it?). Come to think of it, I never realised cats went for pigeons.', '2006-03-07 22:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
