(2209983, 302944, 31443, '<td valign="top">4 wiggly kids in one symmetrical shot? You are a brave photographer :) wish there was a little more light on the left side, cute and clever shot..</td>', '4 wiggly kids in one symmetrical shot? You are a brave photographer :) wish there was a little more light on the left side, cute and clever shot..', '2006-03-08 03:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2209994, 303680, 31443, '<td valign="top">Just love the feeling of open spaces and clean air, don''t know if you could have sharpened this a little more, like it the way it is though..</td>', 'Just love the feeling of open spaces and clean air, don''t know if you could have sharpened this a little more, like it the way it is though..', '2006-03-08 04:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210027, 303520, 16046, '<td valign="top">how about a title like "zz topless", cool dude, well done.</td>', 'how about a title like "zz topless", cool dude, well done.', '2006-03-08 04:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210147, 302278, 6999, '<td valign="top">Masterfully done - little more to say really - obviously highly competent. Reminds me of Bertrand''s portraits (though i hope you havd a little less fanfare than he does around the shoot).</td>', 'Masterfully done - little more to say really - obviously highly competent. Reminds me of Bertrand''s portraits (though i hope you havd a little less fanfare than he does around the shoot).', '2006-03-08 05:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210154, 302632, 6999, '<td valign="top">An evidently interesting structure and location - I''m not wholly convinced that you''ve really found a way into the ''heart'' of it with your image. Without knowing details and your options, this point of view makes for quite confused viewing: the lines made by the tops of the trees and the hillside, the river, the island, and the foreground trees all work against allowing the simplicity of the structure to stand out. The deep rust colour is interesting, but just not dominant enough in this framing I think.</td>', 'An evidently interesting structure and location - I''m not wholly convinced that you''ve really found a way into the ''heart'' of it with your image. Without knowing details and your options, this point of view makes for quite confused viewing: the lines made by the tops of the trees and the hillside, the river, the island, and the foreground trees all work against allowing the simplicity of the structure to stand out. The deep rust colour is interesting, but just not dominant enough in this framing I think.', '2006-03-08 05:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210159, 303044, 6999, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this image works well in a square crop - it seems to me to cry out for a portrait framing, so that the seat and lampost balance the two figures; so you''ve made it fit the challenge by forcing a sqaure crop on an image, rathr than finding an image that works in square. There are strong elements here - the mottled light and the textures of the seat could be interesting, but to my eye it isn''t effective in the required format.</td>', 'I don''t think this image works well in a square crop - it seems to me to cry out for a portrait framing, so that the seat and lampost balance the two figures; so you''ve made it fit the challenge by forcing a sqaure crop on an image, rathr than finding an image that works in square. There are strong elements here - the mottled light and the textures of the seat could be interesting, but to my eye it isn''t effective in the required format.', '2006-03-08 05:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210167, 301819, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst I appreciate the high-contrast and high-key elements of the image (an idea to hold onto for the next high-key challenge, actually), I find the progression to the white negative space to be pretty sudden - perhaps a function of your low point of view as much as anything, but nevertheless a bit abrupt. That very abruptness works against the image sitting well in the square crop also, I think: interesting work, but perhaps just short of outstanding for me.</td>', 'Whilst I appreciate the high-contrast and high-key elements of the image (an idea to hold onto for the next high-key challenge, actually), I find the progression to the white negative space to be pretty sudden - perhaps a function of your low point of view as much as anything, but nevertheless a bit abrupt. That very abruptness works against the image sitting well in the square crop also, I think: interesting work, but perhaps just short of outstanding for me.', '2006-03-08 05:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210172, 303092, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fun portrait - are their teeth <i>really</i> that white? The dappled light seems bizarre - very localised, and irregular - but if its burning then i don''t get your choice of points in frame for it. Pretty good concersion - neat, smooth, detailed, but maybe just lacking a touch of contrast punch?</td>', 'Fun portrait - are their teeth really that white? The dappled light seems bizarre - very localised, and irregular - but if its burning then i don''t get your choice of points in frame for it. Pretty good concersion - neat, smooth, detailed, but maybe just lacking a touch of contrast punch?', '2006-03-08 05:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210174, 303388, 6999, '<td valign="top">Marvellous. A thorough underatnding of the requirements of the crop, great detail, great light. The tiniest piece of tail showing ... I think I would have cloned that out, it just adds a slight element of complexity to a wonderfully graphic image.</td>', 'Marvellous. A thorough underatnding of the requirements of the crop, great detail, great light. The tiniest piece of tail showing ... I think I would have cloned that out, it just adds a slight element of complexity to a wonderfully graphic image.', '2006-03-08 05:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210201, 303029, 31889, '<td valign="top">Man I sat here a few seconds waiting for the rest of the image to download before realising there is no more.  I guess I don''t have to tell you that it''s gonna hurt your score.  <br/> <br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26</td>', 'Man I sat here a few seconds waiting for the rest of the image to download before realising there is no more.  I guess I don''t have to tell you that it''s gonna hurt your score.   //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26', '2006-03-08 06:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210208, 302278, 31889, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2006-03-08 06:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210210, 303503, 31889, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2006-03-08 06:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210222, 301622, 31889, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmmm.....nice creamy bokeh.</td>', 'Mmmmmmm.....nice creamy bokeh.', '2006-03-08 06:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210248, 303434, 31889, '<td valign="top">Very nice....good luck.</td>', 'Very nice....good luck.', '2006-03-08 06:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210256, 303485, 31889, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait and a captivating subject.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice portrait and a captivating subject.  Well done.', '2006-03-08 06:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210297, 303116, 6999, '<td valign="top">Something discomforts my eye about this composition. Perhaps that the foreground stone thing crowds the building a bit too much, or perhaps that the two objects demand equal attention, and leave the eye with nowhere to rest.</td>', 'Something discomforts my eye about this composition. Perhaps that the foreground stone thing crowds the building a bit too much, or perhaps that the two objects demand equal attention, and leave the eye with nowhere to rest.', '2006-03-08 07:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210302, 303585, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is an oddly familiar scene - I don''t suppose it''s the Trafalgar Tavern, is it? Whatever. neat work - especially with the depth of field. It feels just slightly uncentred, which just puts the eye off slightly; square crop works well for a really symmetrical image I think, and the slight non-centring, even if an optical illusion, disturbs here.</td>', 'This is an oddly familiar scene - I don''t suppose it''s the Trafalgar Tavern, is it? Whatever. neat work - especially with the depth of field. It feels just slightly uncentred, which just puts the eye off slightly; square crop works well for a really symmetrical image I think, and the slight non-centring, even if an optical illusion, disturbs here.', '2006-03-08 07:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210305, 303319, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail, sharpness, focus, colour. Overall an absolutely competent shot. Has a certain near-rendered quality to it.</td>', 'Beautiful detail, sharpness, focus, colour. Overall an absolutely competent shot. Has a certain near-rendered quality to it.', '2006-03-08 07:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210360, 302715, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst this composition certainly works for the required aspect ratio, the image itself comes across as a bit muddled - the combination of over exposed elements, the motionblur of the water, and a lack of really clear fous on the ice makes it hard to find a point to hold the eye. A pity - with clearer details and more careful exposure this might have been very effective.</td>', 'Whilst this composition certainly works for the required aspect ratio, the image itself comes across as a bit muddled - the combination of over exposed elements, the motionblur of the water, and a lack of really clear fous on the ice makes it hard to find a point to hold the eye. A pity - with clearer details and more careful exposure this might have been very effective.', '2006-03-08 07:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210366, 302755, 6999, '<td valign="top">A nice study, particularly on the ends of the wings, where the feathers give you more contrast to work with. Not completely sure that your focus is spot-on (close though), and I wonder if the image couldn''t just use more contrast overall, more punch. Perhaps there are too many angles nad crossings of the birds to make for a very easy look - they eye is constantly forced to move around, never to rest.</td>', 'A nice study, particularly on the ends of the wings, where the feathers give you more contrast to work with. Not completely sure that your focus is spot-on (close though), and I wonder if the image couldn''t just use more contrast overall, more punch. Perhaps there are too many angles nad crossings of the birds to make for a very easy look - they eye is constantly forced to move around, never to rest.', '2006-03-08 07:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210369, 303334, 6999, '<td valign="top">Seems unbelievably smooth - real or fake? I quite like it however, for the simplicity. I would have more texture to really be excited about the image, a less porcelain look to the feet, and I''m not compleely sure that it really works in the square.</td>', 'Seems unbelievably smooth - real or fake? I quite like it however, for the simplicity. I would have more texture to really be excited about the image, a less porcelain look to the feet, and I''m not compleely sure that it really works in the square.', '2006-03-08 07:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210374, 302959, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite punchy colour-wise, but just too lacking in detail and a sense of real sharpness to di justice to your vision. Sharpening is at too high a radius, contrast is pushed quite heavily without being controlled, so that small areas have become simple blocks rather than keeping any distinction - it has the look of coming from a very cheap camera, actually, so i don''t know if it''s poor processing or just over-ambitious for your tools.</td>', 'Quite punchy colour-wise, but just too lacking in detail and a sense of real sharpness to di justice to your vision. Sharpening is at too high a radius, contrast is pushed quite heavily without being controlled, so that small areas have become simple blocks rather than keeping any distinction - it has the look of coming from a very cheap camera, actually, so i don''t know if it''s poor processing or just over-ambitious for your tools.', '2006-03-08 07:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210381, 303539, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent detailing and focus, even a sense of texture in that background, which works. Your handling of the variable light across the frame could have been a little better I think - just at that point where it becomes too bright in the top of frame; some work with selection tools rather than just processing the entire image, perhaps - it has that feel about it.</td>', 'Excellent detailing and focus, even a sense of texture in that background, which works. Your handling of the variable light across the frame could have been a little better I think - just at that point where it becomes too bright in the top of frame; some work with selection tools rather than just processing the entire image, perhaps - it has that feel about it.', '2006-03-08 07:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210385, 303435, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very poor I''m afraid. Detail, control of the light, processing are all letting this down. The actual colour is OK, and the sense of composition works pretty well for the frame, but becomes very confused at the bottom of the image, taking impact away from the good strong shapes of the main subject cranes.</td>', 'Very poor I''m afraid. Detail, control of the light, processing are all letting this down. The actual colour is OK, and the sense of composition works pretty well for the frame, but becomes very confused at the bottom of the image, taking impact away from the good strong shapes of the main subject cranes.', '2006-03-08 07:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210394, 303513, 28299, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! 10</td>', 'Gorgeous! 10', '2006-03-08 07:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210395, 303440, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures, though perhaps your depth of field is just too shallow, and your processing or control of light also lets things down a touch - the topmost edges seem to drift into overdone highlights. The composition looks promising however, and you evidently have a sense of light - just needs that touch more control either in set-up or in post-processing. I''m really not a fan of that border thing - pushes the image too far towards a simple graphic and away from photography for me.</td>', 'Interesting textures, though perhaps your depth of field is just too shallow, and your processing or control of light also lets things down a touch - the topmost edges seem to drift into overdone highlights. The composition looks promising however, and you evidently have a sense of light - just needs that touch more control either in set-up or in post-processing. I''m really not a fan of that border thing - pushes the image too far towards a simple graphic and away from photography for me.', '2006-03-08 07:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210396, 303591, 28299, '<td valign="top">I love that this looks like an illustration! 10</td>', 'I love that this looks like an illustration! 10', '2006-03-08 07:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210398, 303362, 6999, '<td valign="top">Amusing, and slightly intriguing, and certainly different. There''s a slightly mad children''s cartoon sense to it, yet somehow slightly sinister. Don''t quite get that sense of real detail, and the light seems off, the colour balance I mean - lacking a bit of warmth, I think. Fun though.</td>', 'Amusing, and slightly intriguing, and certainly different. There''s a slightly mad children''s cartoon sense to it, yet somehow slightly sinister. Don''t quite get that sense of real detail, and the light seems off, the colour balance I mean - lacking a bit of warmth, I think. Fun though.', '2006-03-08 08:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210403, 302372, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but the exposure has let this down a bit - too much glare around the skin, and perhaps generally over-exposed half-stop or so. It would have more impact, more sense of tone and depth, if the brightness overall were reduced. Oh, and of course, it isn''t really a square crop now, is it?</td>', 'Nice try, but the exposure has let this down a bit - too much glare around the skin, and perhaps generally over-exposed half-stop or so. It would have more impact, more sense of tone and depth, if the brightness overall were reduced. Oh, and of course, it isn''t really a square crop now, is it?', '2006-03-08 08:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210425, 302986, 38509, '<td valign="top">well, good catch ... :-)</td>', 'well, good catch ... :-)', '2006-03-08 08:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210440, 302471, 25355, '<td valign="top">I knew some one would do a photo like this, and it just had to be you, Rikki. ;-)</td>', 'I knew some one would do a photo like this, and it just had to be you, Rikki. ;-)', '2006-03-08 08:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210443, 303679, 25355, '<td valign="top">Loaded indeed, Rikki. ;-) These are translucent dice, so you can tell they''re not "loaded".</td>', 'Loaded indeed, Rikki. ;-) These are translucent dice, so you can tell they''re not "loaded".', '2006-03-08 08:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210450, 303319, 25355, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colours, sharp quality and wonderful pattern. I like it a lot. Well done, Rikki! ;-)</td>', 'Nice bright colours, sharp quality and wonderful pattern. I like it a lot. Well done, Rikki! ;-)', '2006-03-08 08:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210525, 303107, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and DOF</td>', 'Nice capture and DOF', '2006-03-08 08:55:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2210553, 303329, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the photo. Nice and crisp with an interesting DOF, However, I don''t think that its a robin red breast. (Its our state bird!)I''m sure anoother DPCer can identify it correctly (if they haven''t done it already)</td>', 'I like the photo. Nice and crisp with an interesting DOF, However, I don''t think that its a robin red breast. (Its our state bird!)I''m sure anoother DPCer can identify it correctly (if they haven''t done it already)', '2006-03-08 09:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210800, 303344, 48954, '<td valign="top">very cool idea</td>', 'very cool idea', '2006-03-08 10:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210802, 303646, 48954, '<td valign="top">flash is too harsh. diffusing it would be a  good idea</td>', 'flash is too harsh. diffusing it would be a  good idea', '2006-03-08 10:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210803, 303539, 48954, '<td valign="top">this idea has potential but the positioning of the dice isn''t very good i think. i recommend the rule of thirds.</td>', 'this idea has potential but the positioning of the dice isn''t very good i think. i recommend the rule of thirds.', '2006-03-08 10:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2210946, 302607, 47096, '<td valign="top">Perfectly composed. This definitely lends itself well to a square crop.</td>', 'Perfectly composed. This definitely lends itself well to a square crop.', '2006-03-08 11:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211063, 303066, 54731, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2006-03-08 12:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211217, 303019, 18780, '<td valign="top">Wow...</td>', 'Wow...', '2006-03-08 13:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211231, 303113, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good detail, great moment, works in this crop, excellent exposure. My only (very) slight quibble would be with how dark the trees etc. are compared to the bird - perhaps just a touch less contrast there? Minor point - very minor. Fine photograph.</td>', 'Good detail, great moment, works in this crop, excellent exposure. My only (very) slight quibble would be with how dark the trees etc. are compared to the bird - perhaps just a touch less contrast there? Minor point - very minor. Fine photograph.', '2006-03-08 13:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211237, 303270, 39349, '<td valign="top">I like this, well exposed and composed shot. the added bit of color really makes this shot pop! The lines lead you into the shot and overall make this just a pleasure to view. Well done!</td>', 'I like this, well exposed and composed shot. the added bit of color really makes this shot pop! The lines lead you into the shot and overall make this just a pleasure to view. Well done!', '2006-03-08 13:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211238, 302000, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lots of good technical things - especially colour and light; I find the composition a bit lumpy, perhaps cropped a touch too close? For a subject that''s not intrinsically very interesting, I don''t think you''ve managed to add the necessary magic: but it''s entirely competent nevertheless.</td>', 'Lots of good technical things - especially colour and light; I find the composition a bit lumpy, perhaps cropped a touch too close? For a subject that''s not intrinsically very interesting, I don''t think you''ve managed to add the necessary magic: but it''s entirely competent nevertheless.', '2006-03-08 13:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211247, 303359, 39349, '<td valign="top">First off I really like how you made this grainy. I really makes for a well done period shot. The subject is interesting and makes me want to know more about her. The only thing drawing my eye away from her is the light above her head. IMHO it''s just too bright. Still I like this shot, and perhaps a slight change in composition would really make it have some added punch.</td>', 'First off I really like how you made this grainy. I really makes for a well done period shot. The subject is interesting and makes me want to know more about her. The only thing drawing my eye away from her is the light above her head. IMHO it''s just too bright. Still I like this shot, and perhaps a slight change in composition would really make it have some added punch.', '2006-03-08 13:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211249, 302577, 39349, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and composition. Well done entry for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice tones and composition. Well done entry for this challenge.', '2006-03-08 13:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211261, 302708, 39349, '<td valign="top">I love the reeds and the motion you captured. I feel that the trees in the back ground just take a lot away from this shot. I like your perspective and choice of DOF.</td>', 'I love the reeds and the motion you captured. I feel that the trees in the back ground just take a lot away from this shot. I like your perspective and choice of DOF.', '2006-03-08 13:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211268, 303156, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution on this shot. Props for thinking "outside" the box! hehe!</td>', 'Great idea and execution on this shot. Props for thinking "outside" the box! hehe!', '2006-03-08 13:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211275, 303114, 39349, '<td valign="top">I think I would almost like this better without the red cloth in the background. It seems to make this feel a bit too unbalanced. DOF and tones are dead on. I also like the humor, put a smile on my face. Good job and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I think I would almost like this better without the red cloth in the background. It seems to make this feel a bit too unbalanced. DOF and tones are dead on. I also like the humor, put a smile on my face. Good job and good luck with the challenge.', '2006-03-08 13:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211276, 302000, 53316, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  I love dice, and I love the way you captured color and depth so well.</td>', 'Gorgeous!  I love dice, and I love the way you captured color and depth so well.', '2006-03-08 13:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211281, 303601, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great action capture! I''m wondering if the halo around the net is from a tad too much USM? Still a great image. Well done.</td>', 'Great action capture! I''m wondering if the halo around the net is from a tad too much USM? Still a great image. Well done.', '2006-03-08 13:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211285, 303271, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love how every detail is clear!</td>', 'I love how every detail is clear!', '2006-03-08 13:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211290, 302372, 53572, '<td valign="top">the lighting is lovely, the eye itself is beautiful, as are the skin tones.  but, this falls down because the focus is on the eyelashes, which quickly becomes distracting.  we want it to be on that amazingly coloured eye.  there''s another eye closeup, which i actually like less than yours, but i rated it higher purely due to the focus.</td>', 'the lighting is lovely, the eye itself is beautiful, as are the skin tones.  but, this falls down because the focus is on the eyelashes, which quickly becomes distracting.  we want it to be on that amazingly coloured eye.  there''s another eye closeup, which i actually like less than yours, but i rated it higher purely due to the focus.', '2006-03-08 13:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211362, 303584, 24454, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!!!!!!   What a sensational photo for this challenge!  10</td>', 'WOW!!!!!!!!!   What a sensational photo for this challenge!  10', '2006-03-08 13:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211368, 303502, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwww. . .what a sweet pet portrait!  That look he''s giving you is so cute:  "Whuuuut!"   :)  I love it.</td>', 'Awwwwwww. . .what a sweet pet portrait!  That look he''s giving you is so cute:  "Whuuuut!"   :)  I love it.', '2006-03-08 13:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211372, 303369, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this is AWESOME!!!!!   This could not be more perfect.  Not one even tiny nit-pick!  10</td>', 'Oh this is AWESOME!!!!!   This could not be more perfect.  Not one even tiny nit-pick!  10', '2006-03-08 13:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211374, 303069, 24454, '<td valign="top">How PRETTY!!!!!  I love this against that rusty background!</td>', 'How PRETTY!!!!!  I love this against that rusty background!', '2006-03-08 13:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211378, 303243, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh my GOODNESS!   From one who LOVES ducks. . .this one is over the top in appeal!  WHAT a capture!!!  10</td>', 'Oh my GOODNESS!   From one who LOVES ducks. . .this one is over the top in appeal!  WHAT a capture!!!  10', '2006-03-08 13:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211381, 303359, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very striking.  The grain adds interest.  I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very striking.  The grain adds interest.  I like it a lot.', '2006-03-08 14:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211383, 303118, 24454, '<td valign="top">Whooah!!!!!   VERY cool. . .No. . on 2nd thought, this is spectacular!!!!  10</td>', 'Whooah!!!!!   VERY cool. . .No. . on 2nd thought, this is spectacular!!!!  10', '2006-03-08 14:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211388, 303256, 24454, '<td valign="top">What can you say.  This is just stunning photography!!!  I LOVE IT!!!!</td>', 'What can you say.  This is just stunning photography!!!  I LOVE IT!!!!', '2006-03-08 14:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211399, 303482, 18403, '<td valign="top">This scene has great potential.  I think that different lighting, perhaps a different time of day, would help.  Also, more of a silhouette, and no foreground grass.  The out of focus tree is distracting.  But that building is terrific!</td>', 'This scene has great potential.  I think that different lighting, perhaps a different time of day, would help.  Also, more of a silhouette, and no foreground grass.  The out of focus tree is distracting.  But that building is terrific!', '2006-03-08 14:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211435, 303284, 18403, '<td valign="top">A better focus would help.</td>', 'A better focus would help.', '2006-03-08 14:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2211460, 303358, 26756, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  A bit off focus but I think that actually works here.  The way you''ve processed it makes it look a bit old and faded, and the fact that it''s not super-sharp for me doesn''t really detract from the impact.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  A bit off focus but I think that actually works here.  The way you''ve processed it makes it look a bit old and faded, and the fact that it''s not super-sharp for me doesn''t really detract from the impact.  Nicely done.', '2006-03-08 14:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
