(2212685, 303241, 259, '<td valign="top">personally i would like to see a greater tonal range.  nothing is solid white or solid black.  i believe it would have a greater impact if it weren''t so muted looking.</td>', 'personally i would like to see a greater tonal range.  nothing is solid white or solid black.  i believe it would have a greater impact if it weren''t so muted looking.', '2006-03-08 20:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
