(2213596, 303314, 6999, '<td valign="top">Clever composition - though not completely unusual for the square. Excellent details and technicals, of course. Love the intensity of it, and the tonality.</td>', 'Clever composition - though not completely unusual for the square. Excellent details and technicals, of course. Love the intensity of it, and the tonality.', '2006-03-09 05:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213598, 302481, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good colour, detail, depth of field. Does it work square? ... I''m not completely sure: the jaw line is perhaps what bothers me - it seems to upset the balance of the image slightly. Your placing of the visible eye dead centre really works though - I think in square the centre point of the imagae becomes much stronger.</td>', 'Good colour, detail, depth of field. Does it work square? ... I''m not completely sure: the jaw line is perhaps what bothers me - it seems to upset the balance of the image slightly. Your placing of the visible eye dead centre really works though - I think in square the centre point of the imagae becomes much stronger.', '2006-03-09 05:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213599, 303334, 28801, '<td valign="top">A great concept and works very well in B&amp;W. I think sharper focus would have made it just perfect.</td>', 'A great concept and works very well in B&W. I think sharper focus would have made it just perfect.', '2006-03-09 05:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213601, 303284, 6999, '<td valign="top">Has a feel almost from the early days of photography - that blurring, and slightly strange focus, and the overall dark-ish but low contrast feel. the pointing finger makes it feel like a comic entry, but the processing works against that.</td>', 'Has a feel almost from the early days of photography - that blurring, and slightly strange focus, and the overall dark-ish but low contrast feel. the pointing finger makes it feel like a comic entry, but the processing works against that.', '2006-03-09 05:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213602, 303152, 6999, '<td valign="top">Love this - strong sense of composition, and all the technical stuff in place. The fade to black is well done, also.</td>', 'Love this - strong sense of composition, and all the technical stuff in place. The fade to black is well done, also.', '2006-03-09 05:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
