(2213771, 303425, 12611, '<td valign="top">fascinating and wonderous shot; I''m not so sure about the crop here, a bit too "in your face" but that iris is tremendous.good luck.</td>', 'fascinating and wonderous shot; I''m not so sure about the crop here, a bit too "in your face" but that iris is tremendous.good luck.', '2006-03-09 07:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213775, 303484, 12611, '<td valign="top">alternate title "aflac" Nice up close shot; cropped well; shows the vivid colors of the mallard. Makes me want house special duck from china star for dinner.</td>', 'alternate title "aflac" Nice up close shot; cropped well; shows the vivid colors of the mallard. Makes me want house special duck from china star for dinner.', '2006-03-09 07:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213776, 303574, 12611, '<td valign="top">wise entry. whoooo knows how it will do? I love the one prominent eye, the fur-esque feather texture; brilliant.</td>', 'wise entry. whoooo knows how it will do? I love the one prominent eye, the fur-esque feather texture; brilliant.', '2006-03-09 07:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213785, 303095, 12611, '<td valign="top">Very seventies album cover potpourri jar art. I love the mood and feel, the warm cinder block; this is a great square. This is nice; its not flashy so it probably won''t win; but I like it , and that should count for something :)</td>', 'Very seventies album cover potpourri jar art. I love the mood and feel, the warm cinder block; this is a great square. This is nice; its not flashy so it probably won''t win; but I like it , and that should count for something :)', '2006-03-09 08:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213787, 302840, 12611, '<td valign="top">great detail; who ever knew they had rainbow styled wings? The flower looks like popcorn; but you have that wow factor; and rightly so; great shot.</td>', 'great detail; who ever knew they had rainbow styled wings? The flower looks like popcorn; but you have that wow factor; and rightly so; great shot.', '2006-03-09 08:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213793, 303485, 12611, '<td valign="top">The title is a bit distracting (an artist?) any way; I love the unassuming quality of the artist in front of her sculpture? or is it the photographer? SHe''s in balck, shes beautiful but not made up in anyway, she seems more concerned with her art than herself and through that, there is an expression of layers of art here. very nice.</td>', 'The title is a bit distracting (an artist?) any way; I love the unassuming quality of the artist in front of her sculpture? or is it the photographer? SHe''s in balck, shes beautiful but not made up in anyway, she seems more concerned with her art than herself and through that, there is an expression of layers of art here. very nice.', '2006-03-09 08:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213795, 303500, 12611, '<td valign="top">nice action shot; looks like a hand check foul, he got beat! do these guys go to the same hair stylist? I love your angle here with the tight zoom- great clarity.<br/> <br/>March madness! GO Uconn for 3rd in 8 years.</td>', 'nice action shot; looks like a hand check foul, he got beat! do these guys go to the same hair stylist? I love your angle here with the tight zoom- great clarity. March madness! GO Uconn for 3rd in 8 years.', '2006-03-09 08:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
