(2213815, 301937, 6132, '<td valign="top">Put a pipe in the mouth and he would look like Subcomandante Marcos :) A very good portrait and original idea. Good luck!</td>', 'Put a pipe in the mouth and he would look like Subcomandante Marcos :) A very good portrait and original idea. Good luck!', '2006-03-09 08:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213848, 303607, 35545, '<td valign="top">The tilted perspective doesn''t do any thing for me.</td>', 'The tilted perspective doesn''t do any thing for me.', '2006-03-09 09:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213851, 302960, 35545, '<td valign="top">The tilted perspective detracts from the perspective.  Why are the front and the rear of the car chopped off?  This may not have been the best picture for the Square Crop Challenge.</td>', 'The tilted perspective detracts from the perspective.  Why are the front and the rear of the car chopped off?  This may not have been the best picture for the Square Crop Challenge.', '2006-03-09 09:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213853, 303006, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more contrast to set the cranes off from the background.</td>', 'Needs a little more contrast to set the cranes off from the background.', '2006-03-09 09:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213855, 303573, 35545, '<td valign="top">To my eye, the subject matter is not particularly well balanced in the square.</td>', 'To my eye, the subject matter is not particularly well balanced in the square.', '2006-03-09 09:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213858, 303267, 35545, '<td valign="top">Poorly balanced composition.  The bird''s head is too close to the edge, and the top of his wing is cut off.</td>', 'Poorly balanced composition.  The bird''s head is too close to the edge, and the top of his wing is cut off.', '2006-03-09 09:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213863, 302492, 35545, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  Need a tiny bit of detail on the right side of the figure.</td>', 'Too dark.  Need a tiny bit of detail on the right side of the figure.', '2006-03-09 09:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213870, 302251, 35545, '<td valign="top">Looks like the engine is tilting to the right.</td>', 'Looks like the engine is tilting to the right.', '2006-03-09 09:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213875, 302756, 5354, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge - that is its square, but it has little or nothing else to help it along. Lets look a little deeper.<br/> <br/>Horizon - if you are cropping to square then why didn''t you crop to level the horizon. This tells me you have not really looked at your own entry too closely.<br/> <br/>Clouds - Nice interesting shapes, tones are a little over cooked in those blue shadows. Need to use the levels or curves function in PS to ensure that you don''t kill the detail in the shadow.<br/> <br/>Blue Sky - Not a lot of interest here, its using too much space, the horizon could have been 2/3 or even more up the image. Solid blue is ''bland''.<br/> <br/>Point of interest - where does the viewers eye enter the frame, what path does it follow?, where does it come to rest? There is nothing of comfort for the eye, its free to flit around the frame and is therefore ''uncomfortable''.<br/> <br/>I recommend doing some reading on composition and layout, read about the thirds rule, about leading lines, about foreground and background.<br/> <br/>Hope some of this might have helped.</td>', 'Meets the challenge - that is its square, but it has little or nothing else to help it along. Lets look a little deeper. Horizon - if you are cropping to square then why didn''t you crop to level the horizon. This tells me you have not really looked at your own entry too closely. Clouds - Nice interesting shapes, tones are a little over cooked in those blue shadows. Need to use the levels or curves function in PS to ensure that you don''t kill the detail in the shadow. Blue Sky - Not a lot of interest here, its using too much space, the horizon could have been 2/3 or even more up the image. Solid blue is ''bland''. Point of interest - where does the viewers eye enter the frame, what path does it follow?, where does it come to rest? There is nothing of comfort for the eye, its free to flit around the frame and is therefore ''uncomfortable''. I recommend doing some reading on composition and layout, read about the thirds rule, about leading lines, about foreground and background. Hope some of this might have helped.', '2006-03-09 09:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213876, 301871, 35545, '<td valign="top">A nice, soft-focus portrait, but that black border draws my eye right out of the picture.</td>', 'A nice, soft-focus portrait, but that black border draws my eye right out of the picture.', '2006-03-09 09:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213881, 302541, 35545, '<td valign="top">I wish we had some detail on his right eye.  On my monitor it''s coming across as a black blob -- no detail at all.</td>', 'I wish we had some detail on his right eye.  On my monitor it''s coming across as a black blob -- no detail at all.', '2006-03-09 09:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2213896, 303345, 35545, '<td valign="top">Looks way over-processed.</td>', 'Looks way over-processed.', '2006-03-09 09:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
