(2215643, 303398, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay, so I was just in Zion National Park and on the way out I stopped in to get a pizza at a local pie shop. Attached to the pizza shop is a photo gallery that had a very similar shot like this in it. The print was AMAZING! My point? Well my point is this shot is BEAUTIFUL and I''m sure a print of it would be just over the top! I love the blue to red / orange tones that you''ve captured with this amazing sandstone formation. Bravo!</td>', 'Okay, so I was just in Zion National Park and on the way out I stopped in to get a pizza at a local pie shop. Attached to the pizza shop is a photo gallery that had a very similar shot like this in it. The print was AMAZING! My point? Well my point is this shot is BEAUTIFUL and I''m sure a print of it would be just over the top! I love the blue to red / orange tones that you''ve captured with this amazing sandstone formation. Bravo!', '2006-03-09 20:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
