(2215795, 302450, 20530, '<td valign="top">Clever, funny, interesting, sharp and colorful. Not crazy about the border, but it''s still one of my favorites.</td>', 'Clever, funny, interesting, sharp and colorful. Not crazy about the border, but it''s still one of my favorites.', '2006-03-09 21:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215796, 302426, 20530, '<td valign="top">Nice irony. Beautiful light, exposure and composition. Perfect choice for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice irony. Beautiful light, exposure and composition. Perfect choice for this challenge.', '2006-03-09 21:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215800, 303398, 20530, '<td valign="top">I never get tired of good shots of the slot canyons. Great color contrast and beautiful lighting.</td>', 'I never get tired of good shots of the slot canyons. Great color contrast and beautiful lighting.', '2006-03-09 21:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215809, 303369, 20530, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. You''ve captured the essence of these Carolina anoles, and that isn''t easy to do. Nice composition. Very sharp. Great BOKEH.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. You''ve captured the essence of these Carolina anoles, and that isn''t easy to do. Nice composition. Very sharp. Great BOKEH.', '2006-03-09 21:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215812, 303092, 20530, '<td valign="top">Clever and well done. One of my top picks. The only improvement that I can think of would have been to a put a blond in front of the big tree trunk for better contrast.</td>', 'Clever and well done. One of my top picks. The only improvement that I can think of would have been to a put a blond in front of the big tree trunk for better contrast.', '2006-03-09 21:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215817, 302624, 20530, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Placing the subject off-center like this has created the effect of a balanced, rectangular image. Tiny details like a softer light and a slightly more relaxed pose might have made it a little better; but I think it''s really nice.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Placing the subject off-center like this has created the effect of a balanced, rectangular image. Tiny details like a softer light and a slightly more relaxed pose might have made it a little better; but I think it''s really nice.', '2006-03-09 21:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215818, 303368, 20530, '<td valign="top">This is awesome! The harsh light is unfortunate, but everything else is great. Edit: Maybe I meant to say "contrast seems to high to me" Again, I still love this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-13 12:52:05.</i></td>', 'This is awesome! The harsh light is unfortunate, but everything else is great. Edit: Maybe I meant to say "contrast seems to high to me" Again, I still love this one.', '2006-03-09 21:51:40.000000', '2006-03-13 12:52:05.000000', 1),
(2215820, 302283, 20530, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, detail and contrast.</td>', 'Excellent composition, detail and contrast.', '2006-03-09 21:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215822, 302020, 20530, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture!</td>', 'Amazing capture!', '2006-03-09 21:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215825, 303598, 20530, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2006-03-09 21:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215827, 303143, 20530, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity of this one.</td>', 'Love the simplicity of this one.', '2006-03-09 21:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215829, 303276, 20530, '<td valign="top">Oh, flashback! That used to be me. Except we called it "slam-dancing" back in the dark ages. This is a great shot full of energy and expression. Nice focus and good exposure. Good job of freezing a moment in time. My only nitpick is that the two figures in the foreground don''t do much for the composition, IMHO. It doesn''t look like there was any other choice but to include them, though, without chopping off someone else. This is one of my favorites from this challenge.</td>', 'Oh, flashback! That used to be me. Except we called it "slam-dancing" back in the dark ages. This is a great shot full of energy and expression. Nice focus and good exposure. Good job of freezing a moment in time. My only nitpick is that the two figures in the foreground don''t do much for the composition, IMHO. It doesn''t look like there was any other choice but to include them, though, without chopping off someone else. This is one of my favorites from this challenge.', '2006-03-09 21:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215838, 302541, 20530, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF suites this image well. I think the lighting hurts it, though.</td>', 'The shallow DOF suites this image well. I think the lighting hurts it, though.', '2006-03-09 21:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215846, 302669, 20530, '<td valign="top">Nice, diagonal composition. The lack of focus hurts it, and since it''s Advanced Editing, I''d clone out the sensor dust. Lots of potential, though.</td>', 'Nice, diagonal composition. The lack of focus hurts it, and since it''s Advanced Editing, I''d clone out the sensor dust. Lots of potential, though.', '2006-03-09 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215850, 303355, 20530, '<td valign="top">Cute kitty with pretty eyes. The background isn''t especially appealing, and the angle and lighting detract from the shot, IMHO.</td>', 'Cute kitty with pretty eyes. The background isn''t especially appealing, and the angle and lighting detract from the shot, IMHO.', '2006-03-09 22:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215868, 302575, 20530, '<td valign="top">That is a neat group of cool looking frogs. The elements of an interesting composition are in place. However, detail is lost in the lighting and the focus seems to be on the pipe; taking away from the subjects. With better lighting and some creative use of DOF, this has a lot of potential.</td>', 'That is a neat group of cool looking frogs. The elements of an interesting composition are in place. However, detail is lost in the lighting and the focus seems to be on the pipe; taking away from the subjects. With better lighting and some creative use of DOF, this has a lot of potential.', '2006-03-09 22:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215882, 303153, 41521, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft bokeh with a crisp primary subject.  Not to mention a beautiful model.  :)</td>', 'Lovely soft bokeh with a crisp primary subject.  Not to mention a beautiful model.  :)', '2006-03-09 22:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215886, 303022, 41521, '<td valign="top">Very simple and clean.  I like it.  But i''m already married, thanks.  :)</td>', 'Very simple and clean.  I like it.  But i''m already married, thanks.  :)', '2006-03-09 22:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2215893, 302691, 41521, '<td valign="top">Lovely model.  Sweet and innocent, then the nose piercing hits ya.</td>', 'Lovely model.  Sweet and innocent, then the nose piercing hits ya.', '2006-03-09 22:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
