(2215991, 303244, 48954, '<td valign="top">wawaweewa! Look at that detail  near the top of the head and eye. NOw was that edited (not that i would have aproblem with that). too bad the beak isn''t as sharp. very nice. good luck.</td>', 'wawaweewa! Look at that detail  near the top of the head and eye. NOw was that edited (not that i would have aproblem with that). too bad the beak isn''t as sharp. very nice. good luck.', '2006-03-09 22:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
