(2216010, 303408, 17507, '<td valign="top">love the title :)<br/> <br/>this photo has a lot of potential, but its impact is hampered by the flat-looking darker tones. there isn''t much black in this photo... just dark greys, so it winds up looking washed out. some burning might have helped, or the use of a different color channel in the conversion to b/w.</td>', 'love the title :) this photo has a lot of potential, but its impact is hampered by the flat-looking darker tones. there isn''t much black in this photo... just dark greys, so it winds up looking washed out. some burning might have helped, or the use of a different color channel in the conversion to b/w.', '2006-03-09 23:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
