(2217779, 302624, 31889, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice image and I hope it does really well for you.  Infact I showed it to my wife and explained how clever it was to shoot the reflection in the mirror. It gives the illusion of light at the end of a dark hallway.  One minor thing I personally would''ve changed, (had it been me), would have been stronger backlighting,(infront of you), to provide a more detailed silhouette of your legs and bum,( can I say that word?), through the dress.</td>', 'It''s a very nice image and I hope it does really well for you.  Infact I showed it to my wife and explained how clever it was to shoot the reflection in the mirror. It gives the illusion of light at the end of a dark hallway.  One minor thing I personally would''ve changed, (had it been me), would have been stronger backlighting,(infront of you), to provide a more detailed silhouette of your legs and bum,( can I say that word?), through the dress.', '2006-03-10 18:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
