(2217879, 302365, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good photo, great in B&amp;W.<br/>I like two things about that window:<br/>a) no reflections<br/>b) the rain on it makes it just a bit more real<br/> <br/>Apart from that I like the placement of the person. She seems occupied with something. Is it her work, is it a text message on her cellphone? We''ll never know because the menu is in the way. There is some suspense created that way.<br/>Great toning and contrast. 8<br/> <br/>Photographer guessing: JJ?</td>', 'Good photo, great in B&W.I like two things about that window:a) no reflectionsb) the rain on it makes it just a bit more real Apart from that I like the placement of the person. She seems occupied with something. Is it her work, is it a text message on her cellphone? We''ll never know because the menu is in the way. There is some suspense created that way.Great toning and contrast. 8 Photographer guessing: JJ?', '2006-03-10 19:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
