(2217921, 301384, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting and funny how the subject placement and angle create a feeling that this isn''t square crop at all (it is, I know). Nice work!</td>', 'Interesting and funny how the subject placement and angle create a feeling that this isn''t square crop at all (it is, I know). Nice work!', '2006-03-10 19:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2217937, 303066, 3032, '<td valign="top">I knew I had seen this before ''Giorgi''. :)<br/> <br/>I think it looks better 90 degrees clowise rotated, but it could be because I like the looks of the right upper girl the most. :) You''ve got some nice portraits of her in your Hamburg stad oper gallery as well.<br/>There is also an interesting (well, interesting, maybe I have been looking to long at these lovely girls) balance of eyebrows. The north and south girls have round flowing ones, while the west and east girls have a hard bend in them. And now that I''m looking at stuff like that, the same balance applies to shirts covering necks or not. Staring into four pair of beautiful eyes at 01.50 in the night makes me a little bit insane I guess.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I knew I had seen this before ''Giorgi''. :) I think it looks better 90 degrees clowise rotated, but it could be because I like the looks of the right upper girl the most. :) You''ve got some nice portraits of her in your Hamburg stad oper gallery as well.There is also an interesting (well, interesting, maybe I have been looking to long at these lovely girls) balance of eyebrows. The north and south girls have round flowing ones, while the west and east girls have a hard bend in them. And now that I''m looking at stuff like that, the same balance applies to shirts covering necks or not. Staring into four pair of beautiful eyes at 01.50 in the night makes me a little bit insane I guess. ', '2006-03-10 19:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
