(2219421, 302876, 34217, '<td valign="top">Her hands look so big because they are in front.  If you had  pulled out a bit I don''t think they would have looked so large, bit I like the closeness and the facial expression.  I just can''t get past those hands.  Maybe if they were not lighter than her face they would not jump out at me.  It is still a nice portrait, but it would have been better without hands</td>', 'Her hands look so big because they are in front.  If you had  pulled out a bit I don''t think they would have looked so large, bit I like the closeness and the facial expression.  I just can''t get past those hands.  Maybe if they were not lighter than her face they would not jump out at me.  It is still a nice portrait, but it would have been better without hands', '2006-03-11 15:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
