(2219426, 303513, 34217, '<td valign="top">I really dislike spot coloring, however if done well I don''t wote down because I know other like it.  Your photo is over done.  the colors should be subtle.  The focus of your shot should be this beautiful little girl and instead all I can see is this flower cause it is so bright.  Bring the saturation way down or all the way down, the shot will be much better.  Also a little more contrast could not hurt</td>', 'I really dislike spot coloring, however if done well I don''t wote down because I know other like it.  Your photo is over done.  the colors should be subtle.  The focus of your shot should be this beautiful little girl and instead all I can see is this flower cause it is so bright.  Bring the saturation way down or all the way down, the shot will be much better.  Also a little more contrast could not hurt', '2006-03-11 15:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2219428, 303272, 34217, '<td valign="top">You do not need this border.  the photo is interesting without it.  I think it takes away</td>', 'You do not need this border.  the photo is interesting without it.  I think it takes away', '2006-03-11 15:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
