(2219433, 303676, 34217, '<td valign="top">Her facial expression is a bit creepy and whatever you did to her skin is not flatering.  retouching should be sublte. Also on a protrait your light source should be eye level or higher.  Your light source is lower than that and it is not as flatering for women or men</td>', 'Her facial expression is a bit creepy and whatever you did to her skin is not flatering.  retouching should be sublte. Also on a protrait your light source should be eye level or higher.  Your light source is lower than that and it is not as flatering for women or men', '2006-03-11 15:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
