(2219444, 303506, 34217, '<td valign="top">This is a good catch.  I do think it looks a little messy.  I prefer clean high speed shots.  Maybe one strawberry in mild with a lower camera angle and more exciting light.  However, we have seen so many of these types of shots on dcp I would love to see a different subject.  I still think you did a good job and everyone has to do this shot once i guess.  Even I have a high speed catch in my portfolio.</td>', 'This is a good catch.  I do think it looks a little messy.  I prefer clean high speed shots.  Maybe one strawberry in mild with a lower camera angle and more exciting light.  However, we have seen so many of these types of shots on dcp I would love to see a different subject.  I still think you did a good job and everyone has to do this shot once i guess.  Even I have a high speed catch in my portfolio.', '2006-03-11 16:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
