(2219464, 303503, 34217, '<td valign="top">This photo is ok.  I think it could be better.  I think your ratio of light to shadow on the girls face is a little dark for a child.  A 1:3 ratio would have been better.  I also think her facial expression leaves a little to be desired.  I love serious facial expressions on children, but she looks scared it is in the eyebrows.  I am a childrens photographer and I always am looking to make sure that the eyebrows are relaxed, it makes for a more peaceful photo.  Also those letters on her dress really pop out at me.  I would prefer something more simple.  Overall, I think it is better than most people can do with kids.  I am probably a little more critical since photographing kids is my job.  Good job</td>', 'This photo is ok.  I think it could be better.  I think your ratio of light to shadow on the girls face is a little dark for a child.  A 1:3 ratio would have been better.  I also think her facial expression leaves a little to be desired.  I love serious facial expressions on children, but she looks scared it is in the eyebrows.  I am a childrens photographer and I always am looking to make sure that the eyebrows are relaxed, it makes for a more peaceful photo.  Also those letters on her dress really pop out at me.  I would prefer something more simple.  Overall, I think it is better than most people can do with kids.  I am probably a little more critical since photographing kids is my job.  Good job', '2006-03-11 16:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2219465, 302768, 36882, '<td valign="top">love it!</td>', 'love it!', '2006-03-11 16:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
