(2220258, 303520, 33435, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, but leaving the photo untitled in this case was such a waste.  How about "Badass", "Bald Bart", "Custer Grizzley", "Mac", "Sonny Dey", "Ol'' Sunshine Himself", "Dr. Butter", "Gunz McMurphy", "Straight Shooter", "T-Rex", etc.  Still a good photo, and titles by no way affect my vote, but have some fun with shots like this.</td>', 'This is a great photo, but leaving the photo untitled in this case was such a waste.  How about "Badass", "Bald Bart", "Custer Grizzley", "Mac", "Sonny Dey", "Ol'' Sunshine Himself", "Dr. Butter", "Gunz McMurphy", "Straight Shooter", "T-Rex", etc.  Still a good photo, and titles by no way affect my vote, but have some fun with shots like this.', '2006-03-11 23:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
