(2220522, 303595, 36808, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for texture and this one so wonderful.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for texture and this one so wonderful.', '2006-03-12 00:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2220674, 303528, 19831, '<td valign="top">Well, you''re probably getting hammered in the voting on this one. Not necessarily a bad thing in this case, depending on what you were going for. If this is just a lame attempt at pre-pubescent humor...try growing up. But...if you actually thought this one out, and were trying to invoke a reaction from the viewer, than a gleaming success. You caught my attention. An extremely negative gut reaction, but a strong reaction none the less. A bowl full of stale piss, very high on my list of disgusting things :-) On the technical side, perhaps the presentation could be a little stronger. The point of view not to bad, a bit mundane, but it is relatable. I don''t like how the front of the bowl is cut off though. And there does seem to be just a bit of a clockwise skew to the image. It is very slight, but I think to play on the symmetry in the shot, care should be taken to be dead on, especially for a square crop. Lighting seems to be a tad harsh, like maybe you used on board flash? If so, perhaps diffusing it some could help. The whites of the bowl just come across a little too harsh, on the verge of being blown out, and heavy shadows at the top of the image from the acute angle. Focus does seem like it could be a little sharper. And maybe a smaller aperture to increase dof could make a little difference. <br/>Overall, not very appealing to me personally, subject matter wise, but it does invoke a strong reaction. Like ''Ewww!!!'' And technically, not horrible, but could definitely be stronger. And like I said, if a shot at the brown, or ''potty'' humor, then I''m just not diggin'' it. Might be different without the stale piss. Best of luck.</td>', 'Well, you''re probably getting hammered in the voting on this one. Not necessarily a bad thing in this case, depending on what you were going for. If this is just a lame attempt at pre-pubescent humor...try growing up. But...if you actually thought this one out, and were trying to invoke a reaction from the viewer, than a gleaming success. You caught my attention. An extremely negative gut reaction, but a strong reaction none the less. A bowl full of stale piss, very high on my list of disgusting things :-) On the technical side, perhaps the presentation could be a little stronger. The point of view not to bad, a bit mundane, but it is relatable. I don''t like how the front of the bowl is cut off though. And there does seem to be just a bit of a clockwise skew to the image. It is very slight, but I think to play on the symmetry in the shot, care should be taken to be dead on, especially for a square crop. Lighting seems to be a tad harsh, like maybe you used on board flash? If so, perhaps diffusing it some could help. The whites of the bowl just come across a little too harsh, on the verge of being blown out, and heavy shadows at the top of the image from the acute angle. Focus does seem like it could be a little sharper. And maybe a smaller aperture to increase dof could make a little difference. Overall, not very appealing to me personally, subject matter wise, but it does invoke a strong reaction. Like ''Ewww!!!'' And technically, not horrible, but could definitely be stronger. And like I said, if a shot at the brown, or ''potty'' humor, then I''m just not diggin'' it. Might be different without the stale piss. Best of luck.', '2006-03-12 01:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
