(2222600, 303461, 35545, '<td valign="top">I wish you hadn''t cut off the top of her head.</td>', 'I wish you hadn''t cut off the top of her head.', '2006-03-12 20:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222605, 303054, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful church, and I like the solitary figure approaching it, but those fake angel wings are really becoming a cliche.</td>', 'Beautiful church, and I like the solitary figure approaching it, but those fake angel wings are really becoming a cliche.', '2006-03-12 20:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222608, 303348, 35545, '<td valign="top">The massive brick wall overwhelms the dogs.  You really have two pictures here.</td>', 'The massive brick wall overwhelms the dogs.  You really have two pictures here.', '2006-03-12 20:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222649, 303271, 50565, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2006-03-12 20:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222652, 303434, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Too bad there isn''t a camel standing up in that area to the right. LOL  Beautiful shadow and light play. Great use of complementary colors too!! Bumping up after 2nd review.  I''ve not looked in 5 days - wow this is terrific.</td>', 'Lovely.  Too bad there isn''t a camel standing up in that area to the right. LOL  Beautiful shadow and light play. Great use of complementary colors too!! Bumping up after 2nd review.  I''ve not looked in 5 days - wow this is terrific.', '2006-03-12 20:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222654, 303680, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity.  Beautiful snowy scene. Excellent sky. Bumping up after 2nd review. 8 My one nitpick is it''s slightly "off kilter" - I might rotate ever so slightly to the left.</td>', 'Love the simplicity.  Beautiful snowy scene. Excellent sky. Bumping up after 2nd review. 8 My one nitpick is it''s slightly "off kilter" - I might rotate ever so slightly to the left.', '2006-03-12 20:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222656, 303244, 15711, '<td valign="top">Something about this that I really like.  The layering of the feathers, the perspective. No that''s not it... something about the clarity of it all.  Good job!!!</td>', 'Something about this that I really like.  The layering of the feathers, the perspective. No that''s not it... something about the clarity of it all.  Good job!!!', '2006-03-12 20:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222659, 303558, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a softness. I like the microscopic detail.  It''s very intriguing.  You want to study every inch of that dead leaf. Nicely done and not the usual.  I''m bumping it up from my original score.</td>', 'This has a softness. I like the microscopic detail.  It''s very intriguing.  You want to study every inch of that dead leaf. Nicely done and not the usual.  I''m bumping it up from my original score.', '2006-03-12 20:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222660, 302840, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice close up and great DOF. I like that the flowers are white, blending into nothing.  Good detailing on the bug!!</td>', 'Nice close up and great DOF. I like that the flowers are white, blending into nothing.  Good detailing on the bug!!', '2006-03-12 20:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222662, 303485, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has kind of a weird off sense with the floating whatever-they-are and the shadows.  Her face is clear and the lighting is good. Has an edginess to it.</td>', 'This has kind of a weird off sense with the floating whatever-they-are and the shadows.  Her face is clear and the lighting is good. Has an edginess to it.', '2006-03-12 20:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222663, 303019, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I see this on a calendar or nice sofa table book!!! On second review, I''m bumping up further.  If there were a single figure on the bridge, it''d be perfect. 9</td>', 'Very pretty.  I see this on a calendar or nice sofa table book!!! On second review, I''m bumping up further.  If there were a single figure on the bridge, it''d be perfect. 9', '2006-03-12 20:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222665, 303502, 15711, '<td valign="top">I actually laughed out loud.  I looked at his expression, THEN the title.  My only complaint is the background, but heh, a dog on a couch is much more apt to pose than one standing in a studio with some black paper behind him!!! I am on 2nd review and I''m bumping up.  Fooey on the couch - the dog rocks!!!</td>', 'I actually laughed out loud.  I looked at his expression, THEN the title.  My only complaint is the background, but heh, a dog on a couch is much more apt to pose than one standing in a studio with some black paper behind him!!! I am on 2nd review and I''m bumping up.  Fooey on the couch - the dog rocks!!!', '2006-03-12 20:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222666, 303015, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is very artsy.  I like the mystry and the dark and light. Maybe if the flowers were off to the viewer''s right a bit, it might give a touch of balance.  Just a nitpick - I like it.</td>', 'This is very artsy.  I like the mystry and the dark and light. Maybe if the flowers were off to the viewer''s right a bit, it might give a touch of balance.  Just a nitpick - I like it.', '2006-03-12 20:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222669, 303541, 15711, '<td valign="top">Is this an optical illusion, or is there a slight tilt to the right?  Maybe it''s the box inside the box.  I can''t figure it out.</td>', 'Is this an optical illusion, or is there a slight tilt to the right?  Maybe it''s the box inside the box.  I can''t figure it out.', '2006-03-12 20:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222670, 303678, 15711, '<td valign="top">The complementary blue/gold is nice.  It''s not a particularly unusual shot, but something about it is very comforting.  I can imagine a field of cattle grazing under the beautiful blue sky.  It gives you pause and a moment to explore your imagination.</td>', 'The complementary blue/gold is nice.  It''s not a particularly unusual shot, but something about it is very comforting.  I can imagine a field of cattle grazing under the beautiful blue sky.  It gives you pause and a moment to explore your imagination.', '2006-03-12 20:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222671, 303369, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh effect.  He does look like he''s singing his heart out.  Vivid colors.  My one nitpick - cut the green border. I know it''s the color of the lizard, but I''m not crazy about it in this case.  Maybe have the black wider and the green 2 pixels or so - I think that''d work better for me. Great tack sharp focus!!</td>', 'Great bokeh effect.  He does look like he''s singing his heart out.  Vivid colors.  My one nitpick - cut the green border. I know it''s the color of the lizard, but I''m not crazy about it in this case.  Maybe have the black wider and the green 2 pixels or so - I think that''d work better for me. Great tack sharp focus!!', '2006-03-12 20:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222672, 303359, 2553, '<td valign="top">I normally vote all the way through before I begin to comment, but had to comment on this now.  It looks almost like a magazine or newpaper photo that has been scanned.  I''m not certain about the processing you may have used for this shot, but I am certain that I do not care for it.  The photo is generally very soft, and to me, messy looking; and her eyes are absolutely dead center, which I also do not care for.  My eyes are drawn more to all the "stuff" in the photo, than to the subject itself.  Had this been a crisp candid, especially if you could really see her eyes well, I would have given it a better score.  5</td>', 'I normally vote all the way through before I begin to comment, but had to comment on this now.  It looks almost like a magazine or newpaper photo that has been scanned.  I''m not certain about the processing you may have used for this shot, but I am certain that I do not care for it.  The photo is generally very soft, and to me, messy looking; and her eyes are absolutely dead center, which I also do not care for.  My eyes are drawn more to all the "stuff" in the photo, than to the subject itself.  Had this been a crisp candid, especially if you could really see her eyes well, I would have given it a better score.  5', '2006-03-12 20:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222678, 303422, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple yet quite stunning.  My only critique is they lack the lustre I''m looking for.  The composition and light are fine, but there is a certain flatness about the whole image.  Maybe it was the desaturation. I''ve had that happen sometimes when going to black and white. I''d love to see the color version.  7</td>', 'Simple yet quite stunning.  My only critique is they lack the lustre I''m looking for.  The composition and light are fine, but there is a certain flatness about the whole image.  Maybe it was the desaturation. I''ve had that happen sometimes when going to black and white. I''d love to see the color version.  7', '2006-03-12 20:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222679, 301937, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sure is a cute robber!!!  Nice off center subject. Good lighting. Beautiful eyes. On second review, I think I''d love a black background so his dark mask just kind of fades - like a real robber, about to snatch something into the night.  I''d crop to not show the skin of the neck too.</td>', 'Sure is a cute robber!!!  Nice off center subject. Good lighting. Beautiful eyes. On second review, I think I''d love a black background so his dark mask just kind of fades - like a real robber, about to snatch something into the night.  I''d crop to not show the skin of the neck too.', '2006-03-12 20:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222688, 303341, 22734, '<td valign="top">What a lovely eyefull! Bump.</td>', 'What a lovely eyefull! Bump.', '2006-03-12 20:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222689, 302676, 22734, '<td valign="top">Quite a capture. Bump</td>', 'Quite a capture. Bump', '2006-03-12 20:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
