(2222708, 302946, 14620, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why I like this shot so much, but I do.  The lighting is great.  It''s just a cool shot. 9</td>', 'I don''t know why I like this shot so much, but I do.  The lighting is great.  It''s just a cool shot. 9', '2006-03-12 20:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
