(2222717, 303015, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very intriguing photo.  I enjoy the darkness of it and light light in her eye.  Not sure if I like the flowers at the bottom or not. But overall, it''s a great composition. 9</td>', 'Wow!  Very intriguing photo.  I enjoy the darkness of it and light light in her eye.  Not sure if I like the flowers at the bottom or not. But overall, it''s a great composition. 9', '2006-03-12 20:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
