(2222728, 302365, 14620, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.  Great candid and the b&amp;w treatment is really good.  Just wish it was a tad bit bigger so I could drink in more of the little details. 9</td>', 'One of my favorites.  Great candid and the b&w treatment is really good.  Just wish it was a tad bit bigger so I could drink in more of the little details. 9', '2006-03-12 21:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
