(2223461, 302624, 37961, '<td valign="top">Well Judy. You got robbed on this one. This is one of the most creative things you''ve done to date and I think you have really captured your physical beauty as well as your self expression. Keep doing what you love, there are those of us who really appreciate and value your vision of art.</td>', 'Well Judy. You got robbed on this one. This is one of the most creative things you''ve done to date and I think you have really captured your physical beauty as well as your self expression. Keep doing what you love, there are those of us who really appreciate and value your vision of art.', '2006-03-13 01:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
