(2223597, 302624, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful image, Judy. Very well done. Personally I think it beats 2 lizards and a slinky, but I only get one vote. ;-) Is that how you run around he house?? :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL. Yeah this one is pretty creative and has more lasting appeal I think.</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Beautiful image, Judy. Very well done. Personally I think it beats 2 lizards and a slinky, but I only get one vote. ;-) Is that how you run around he house?? :)   LOL. Yeah this one is pretty creative and has more lasting appeal I think.', '2006-03-13 01:55:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2223602, 302986, 3214, '<td valign="top">Interesting scoring on this one, I think a lot of people underestimate the difficulty of this capture, especially from the DOF standpoint!  Love the rich tones, works well as a square.</td>', 'Interesting scoring on this one, I think a lot of people underestimate the difficulty of this capture, especially from the DOF standpoint!  Love the rich tones, works well as a square.', '2006-03-13 01:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2223622, 303055, 15711, '<td valign="top">Way under rated.</td>', 'Way under rated.', '2006-03-13 02:03:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2223632, 303380, 49858, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Strontious:</b></div><hr/><i> a center composition? WHY??? placed off to the left, following the rule of thirds would have made this a MUCH better photograph </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Why the centre composition?..... I tried it as an off center ROT crop, but somehow it just didn''t work as a 640x640 crop.  I wonder if it''s because the focal point on the windmill is the centre of the 4 sails?<br/> <br/>Any comments/ideas?<br/> <br/>Several people commented that a full on front view would have worked better for the "square crop", but unfortunately the front view would have had a housing estate as the background.</td>', 'Originally posted by Strontious: a center composition? WHY??? placed off to the left, following the rule of thirds would have made this a MUCH better photograph   Why the centre composition?..... I tried it as an off center ROT crop, but somehow it just didn''t work as a 640x640 crop.  I wonder if it''s because the focal point on the windmill is the centre of the 4 sails? Any comments/ideas? Several people commented that a full on front view would have worked better for the "square crop", but unfortunately the front view would have had a housing estate as the background.', '2006-03-13 02:07:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2223642, 303528, 37893, '<td valign="top">Um Floyd. Are you trying to get a DPC record of having the most browns? :P<br/> <br/>At least capture the whole bowl man! LOL!</td>', 'Um Floyd. Are you trying to get a DPC record of having the most browns? :P At least capture the whole bowl man! LOL!', '2006-03-13 02:10:35.000000', NULL, 0),
