(2224668, 302618, 33068, '<td valign="top">The first thing that caught my eye (as with many others from what I have read) is the beautiful pastel colors. So serene and calming.  I also love the emotion you''ve captured with this shot.  The look on the child''s face is so telling.  This is a blue in my book and marking as a fav.</td>', 'The first thing that caught my eye (as with many others from what I have read) is the beautiful pastel colors. So serene and calming.  I also love the emotion you''ve captured with this shot.  The look on the child''s face is so telling.  This is a blue in my book and marking as a fav.', '2006-03-13 13:31:35.000000', NULL, 0),
