(2224908, 303118, 37893, '<td valign="top">Well good try kiddo! Not enough to pull through though :P<br/> <br/>Seriously, I gave this image an 8 because I know how hard it is to be able to capture something like this. This requires both technicals and creativity in framing the subject. I''m kinda bummed though that there were lots of images such as this that scored lower than what I had initially hoped.<br/> <br/>You have one fave so that''s a plus in itself ;)</td>', 'Well good try kiddo! Not enough to pull through though :P Seriously, I gave this image an 8 because I know how hard it is to be able to capture something like this. This requires both technicals and creativity in framing the subject. I''m kinda bummed though that there were lots of images such as this that scored lower than what I had initially hoped. You have one fave so that''s a plus in itself ;)', '2006-03-13 15:29:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2224913, 303644, 48890, '<td valign="top">What''s there to like about this picture, other than its proper exposure and focus? I''m sorry to say this, but it''s just not interesting in any way: no unusual perspective, no interesting composition, no particularly good colours/shapes/textures, no plot or story behind it.<br/> <br/>I don''t understand what moved you to send this in for a challenge.</td>', 'What''s there to like about this picture, other than its proper exposure and focus? I''m sorry to say this, but it''s just not interesting in any way: no unusual perspective, no interesting composition, no particularly good colours/shapes/textures, no plot or story behind it. I don''t understand what moved you to send this in for a challenge.', '2006-03-13 15:30:55.000000', NULL, 0),
