(2224948, 303121, 33652, '<td valign="top">Aw they''re cute lil guys! Nice shot!</td>', 'Aw they''re cute lil guys! Nice shot!', '2006-03-13 15:39:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2224953, 303029, 48890, '<td valign="top">I like the colours, light, and the unorthodox placement of the clouds alongside the frame''s edges, with empty sky filling most of the frame.  I don''t like the horizontal black band in the bottom, I think that the image would be much better with it cut off (I realize that it won''t be fit for this challenge then), and I don''t think it adds anything to this shot.</td>', 'I like the colours, light, and the unorthodox placement of the clouds alongside the frame''s edges, with empty sky filling most of the frame.  I don''t like the horizontal black band in the bottom, I think that the image would be much better with it cut off (I realize that it won''t be fit for this challenge then), and I don''t think it adds anything to this shot.', '2006-03-13 15:41:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2225005, 302775, 37893, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments guys! I will never understand why voters with no cameras seem to vote this image down. Look at the disparity of the votes. Amazing. I''m just glad I scored above a 6 so I didn''t have to eat my shorts ;)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments guys! I will never understand why voters with no cameras seem to vote this image down. Look at the disparity of the votes. Amazing. I''m just glad I scored above a 6 so I didn''t have to eat my shorts ;)', '2006-03-13 15:56:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2225095, 303256, 14603, '<td valign="top">We are going to bump into one another one of these times :)<br/> <br/>It`s a great area for pics and you have pulled a super one out of the hat here...well done<br/> <br/></td>', 'We are going to bump into one another one of these times :) It`s a great area for pics and you have pulled a super one out of the hat here...well done ', '2006-03-13 16:37:23.000000', NULL, 0);
