(2225606, 303644, 31606, '<td valign="top">I think a tigher crop would have done better.  The American Flag shots always get beat up here at DPC.  But I say screw ''em wave it proudly my fellow American.</td>', 'I think a tigher crop would have done better.  The American Flag shots always get beat up here at DPC.  But I say screw ''em wave it proudly my fellow American.', '2006-03-13 20:19:16.000000', NULL, 0),
