(2225643, 303644, 23458, '<td valign="top">I have no problem with patriotism, but to be honest - this is a pretty uninspiring image... the sky is kinda flat and there''s nothing interesting about the composition. <br/> <br/>Really - a 4.7 is about what one could have expected a shot like this to get - irrespective of which nation the flag represents. <br/> <br/>All the best with your future efforts!</td>', 'I have no problem with patriotism, but to be honest - this is a pretty uninspiring image... the sky is kinda flat and there''s nothing interesting about the composition.  Really - a 4.7 is about what one could have expected a shot like this to get - irrespective of which nation the flag represents.  All the best with your future efforts!', '2006-03-13 20:37:38.000000', NULL, 0),
