(2226041, 303311, 26756, '<td valign="top">Surprised this finished so low.  Well, on second thought maybe I''m not, but it''s a great pic.  Compositionally excellent with nice texture all around, especially on the ice.  Great shapes and lines.  I bet this looks great at a much larger size.</td>', 'Surprised this finished so low.  Well, on second thought maybe I''m not, but it''s a great pic.  Compositionally excellent with nice texture all around, especially on the ice.  Great shapes and lines.  I bet this looks great at a much larger size.', '2006-03-14 00:02:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2226085, 302766, 18450, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and tones....and those melt your heart eyes!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-14 00:21:42.</i></td>', 'Lovely lighting and tones....and those melt your heart eyes!!', '2006-03-14 00:21:11.000000', '2006-03-14 00:21:42.000000', 0),
