(2226616, 303019, 12611, '<td valign="top">The composition may be a bit busy here; but who the hell am I to argue!; one thing; I love the focus and texture of that rock; impressionist and beuatiful; and the details of the twigs and such; very nice; congratulations- hope you sell a ton of these.</td>', 'The composition may be a bit busy here; but who the hell am I to argue!; one thing; I love the focus and texture of that rock; impressionist and beuatiful; and the details of the twigs and such; very nice; congratulations- hope you sell a ton of these.', '2006-03-14 07:27:13.000000', NULL, 0),
