(2227607, 303276, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club...<br/> <br/>Hi Bob :)<br/> <br/>This photo did rather well in the context of the challenge and doesn''t really require much critique.  All I may be able to offer is my personal feelings on the image rather than a way to have it score higher...<br/> <br/>The photo obviously meets the challenge and the voters seemed to like it.  Compositionally, it feels a bit odd to me.  It feels like a riot is taking place, and the partial person/object in the lower right seem to be the focal point, and there isn''t enough context there to sort out what is happening.  I''m not familiar with the term "Mosh Pit" so I couldn''t use that to help me understand the image...<br/> <br/>John Setzler<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club... Hi Bob :) This photo did rather well in the context of the challenge and doesn''t really require much critique.  All I may be able to offer is my personal feelings on the image rather than a way to have it score higher... The photo obviously meets the challenge and the voters seemed to like it.  Compositionally, it feels a bit odd to me.  It feels like a riot is taking place, and the partial person/object in the lower right seem to be the focal point, and there isn''t enough context there to sort out what is happening.  I''m not familiar with the term "Mosh Pit" so I couldn''t use that to help me understand the image... John Setzler', '2006-03-14 16:06:48.000000', NULL, 0),
