(2227789, 302775, 48954, '<td valign="top">domes...yeah, not appreciated enough. trust me , i know. I submitted a dome picture for Best of 2005 and I got 530th out of 850 or something of the sort, and i think my shot was great. Architecture....underapreciated on this site hehe. Oh well. good work tough<br/> <br/></td>', 'domes...yeah, not appreciated enough. trust me , i know. I submitted a dome picture for Best of 2005 and I got 530th out of 850 or something of the sort, and i think my shot was great. Architecture....underapreciated on this site hehe. Oh well. good work tough ', '2006-03-14 17:58:30.000000', NULL, 0),
