(2227799, 302488, 52034, '<td valign="top">This definitely doesn''t belong in the bottom 4.</td>', 'This definitely doesn''t belong in the bottom 4.', '2006-03-14 18:03:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2227809, 303015, 42567, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 10!!  Lighting is great, eyes are awesome!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-14 18:13:47.</i></td>', 'Congrats on your top 10!!  Lighting is great, eyes are awesome!', '2006-03-14 18:13:19.000000', '2006-03-14 18:13:47.000000', 0),
(2227813, 303646, 53316, '<td valign="top">As mentioned before, it looks oversharpened - makes it seem like a cardboard cutout to me.  But I really like the earthy colors, and composition, except for the tree in the middle of the background "growing" from the stump in the middle.  I think that takes away some of the depth, adding to the cardboard cutout look.<br/> <br/>Edit:<br/>Forgot to say that if you adjusted the angle so the tree doesn''t seem attached to the stump, the stump would probably be at a less flattering angle.  If that''d be the case, I think what you have done would be the better choice.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-14 22:27:46.</i></td>', 'As mentioned before, it looks oversharpened - makes it seem like a cardboard cutout to me.  But I really like the earthy colors, and composition, except for the tree in the middle of the background "growing" from the stump in the middle.  I think that takes away some of the depth, adding to the cardboard cutout look. Edit:Forgot to say that if you adjusted the angle so the tree doesn''t seem attached to the stump, the stump would probably be at a less flattering angle.  If that''d be the case, I think what you have done would be the better choice.', '2006-03-14 18:15:09.000000', '2006-03-14 22:27:46.000000', 0),
(2227818, 303452, 53316, '<td valign="top">I very much like this.  Great focus, good use of color (or lack thereof) and attention to detail.  I like the half face as that leaves more room for the background, bringing attention to the fact that the background and face are so alike.</td>', 'I very much like this.  Great focus, good use of color (or lack thereof) and attention to detail.  I like the half face as that leaves more room for the background, bringing attention to the fact that the background and face are so alike.', '2006-03-14 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2227822, 302837, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like photos that are a bit more abstract, like yours.  Great job taking an ordinary object (I am assuming napkin or papertowel) and making it look like art.</td>', 'I like photos that are a bit more abstract, like yours.  Great job taking an ordinary object (I am assuming napkin or papertowel) and making it look like art.', '2006-03-14 18:20:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2227824, 303671, 53316, '<td valign="top">Love the model''s expression.</td>', 'Love the model''s expression.', '2006-03-14 18:21:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2227828, 303355, 53316, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop would probably have made this more interesting.  I like the background because the colors and "short lines" feeling matches the coloring of the cat, but as others have noted, the background is a bit overpowering.</td>', 'A tighter crop would probably have made this more interesting.  I like the background because the colors and "short lines" feeling matches the coloring of the cat, but as others have noted, the background is a bit overpowering.', '2006-03-14 18:23:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2227833, 303445, 53316, '<td valign="top">This would probably have done great in a challenge that was geared towards old fashoned images.<br/> <br/>edit: Don''t know if that sounded like a compliment, but it was supposed to be - I had added this to my favorites.  I think it''s very beautiful.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-16 09:59:13.</i></td>', 'This would probably have done great in a challenge that was geared towards old fashoned images. edit: Don''t know if that sounded like a compliment, but it was supposed to be - I had added this to my favorites.  I think it''s very beautiful.', '2006-03-14 18:27:30.000000', '2006-03-16 09:59:13.000000', 0),
(2227837, 302838, 53316, '<td valign="top">The expression on the face is very fitting for the title.  Would probably look better with the focus more on the eyes instead of the nose. <br/> <br/>The face is so round - adorable, but maybe not the best for a square crop?   It just seems like the round isn''t balanced inside the square.  I''d be interested to see what a square crop that was much tighter - just under the lips and near the eye on the right - would look like.  Although I have a feeling that would be a bit off as well.</td>', 'The expression on the face is very fitting for the title.  Would probably look better with the focus more on the eyes instead of the nose.  The face is so round - adorable, but maybe not the best for a square crop?   It just seems like the round isn''t balanced inside the square.  I''d be interested to see what a square crop that was much tighter - just under the lips and near the eye on the right - would look like.  Although I have a feeling that would be a bit off as well.', '2006-03-14 18:32:21.000000', NULL, 0),
