(2227955, 303646, 48228, '<td valign="top">I have learned a valuable lesson here, re this image, as I realized that I "over processed" it so as to get it into the challenge on time.<br/> <br/>I took it on the day of roll-over, so maybe rushed it..... <br/> <br/>I entered it with about 2 minutes to spare, and this is something I will NEVER do again.....<br/> <br/>PLEASE don''t judge me on this image alone but visit my portfolio to see what I have learned and hopefully you will see other that are much better. <br/> <br/>I feel quite ashamed, and I would like to put my head in a brown bag, along with this photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-14 20:17:54.</i></td>', 'I have learned a valuable lesson here, re this image, as I realized that I "over processed" it so as to get it into the challenge on time. I took it on the day of roll-over, so maybe rushed it.....  I entered it with about 2 minutes to spare, and this is something I will NEVER do again..... PLEASE don''t judge me on this image alone but visit my portfolio to see what I have learned and hopefully you will see other that are much better.  I feel quite ashamed, and I would like to put my head in a brown bag, along with this photo.', '2006-03-14 20:14:40.000000', '2006-03-14 20:17:54.000000', 0),
