(2228280, 303445, 34659, '<td valign="top">Personally, I like this image, but the graininess has an unusual appearance.  It almost looks splotchy.  I love the pose and would enjoy seeing different crops and finishes as well.  I think this has a lot of possibility &amp; potential, but was perhaps not best suited for the square crop challenge.</td>', 'Personally, I like this image, but the graininess has an unusual appearance.  It almost looks splotchy.  I love the pose and would enjoy seeing different crops and finishes as well.  I think this has a lot of possibility & potential, but was perhaps not best suited for the square crop challenge.', '2006-03-14 22:17:08.000000', NULL, 0),
