(2230432, 303607, 32321, '<td valign="top">Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>First Impression:<br/>My eyes went to the dark corner, down to the red bricks, then up to the cream coloured corner. Funny black lines at the sky interface. Looks like the sky was cut from paper<br/> <br/>Composition:<br/>Good eye. Lots of colour and texture. I like the way you broke up the square with the 45 degree angle for the top building. A 30 degree angle may have been more pleasing, not as much vertigo!<br/> <br/>Subject:<br/>Met challenge well.<br/> <br/>Technical:<br/>Excellent lighting and colours.  Good DOF. Picture seems a little grainy, may have been to much USM<br/> <br/>Summary:<br/>Good capture, less angle may have been more pleasing.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club. First Impression:My eyes went to the dark corner, down to the red bricks, then up to the cream coloured corner. Funny black lines at the sky interface. Looks like the sky was cut from paper Composition:Good eye. Lots of colour and texture. I like the way you broke up the square with the 45 degree angle for the top building. A 30 degree angle may have been more pleasing, not as much vertigo! Subject:Met challenge well. Technical:Excellent lighting and colours.  Good DOF. Picture seems a little grainy, may have been to much USM Summary:Good capture, less angle may have been more pleasing. ', '2006-03-15 12:25:19.000000', NULL, 0),
