(2231565, 303049, 5885, '<td valign="top"><b><i>::: Greetings from Critique Club :::</i></b> <br/> <br/>Hi, as requested, here is an indepth critique of your submission.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression - the most important one:</b> <br/>Nice texture and lighting. Very well exposed.<br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Composition isn''t this photos strongest point. The choice of crop feels a bit crowded for my tastes.<br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>Discussing subject is sorta pointless for this photo as the texture and shapes of the "columns" are more the subject than the colums themselves I feel. That said, you did well at emphasizing the shape and texture.<br/> <br/><b>Technical (Color, focus, and light):</b> <br/>Color: natural and well balanced.<br/>Focus, sharp as a tack as far as I can tell.<br/>Light, excellent.<br/> <br/><b>To grow its vote?:</b> <br/>Tough challenge, but I feel the crowded composition may have hurt you some. And for many this photo probably didn''t provide much "wow". DPC voters love some sort of wow factor.<br/> <br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Very nice light study. I really like your choice of angle to capture the lighting.<br/> <br/>Hope to see more from you soon,<br/>Leroy</td>', '::: Greetings from Critique Club :::  Hi, as requested, here is an indepth critique of your submission. First Impression - the most important one: Nice texture and lighting. Very well exposed. Composition: Composition isn''t this photos strongest point. The choice of crop feels a bit crowded for my tastes. Subject: Discussing subject is sorta pointless for this photo as the texture and shapes of the "columns" are more the subject than the colums themselves I feel. That said, you did well at emphasizing the shape and texture. Technical (Color, focus, and light): Color: natural and well balanced.Focus, sharp as a tack as far as I can tell.Light, excellent. To grow its vote?: Tough challenge, but I feel the crowded composition may have hurt you some. And for many this photo probably didn''t provide much "wow". DPC voters love some sort of wow factor. Summary: Very nice light study. I really like your choice of angle to capture the lighting. Hope to see more from you soon,Leroy', '2006-03-15 18:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
