(2259568, 302541, 53653, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the critique. I''ve learned alot from this image and the comments everyone has made, it''s amazing the things you don''t see until someone tells you.</td>', 'Thanks for the critique. I''ve learned alot from this image and the comments everyone has made, it''s amazing the things you don''t see until someone tells you.', '2006-03-26 08:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2259915, 302986, 42100, '<td valign="top">What a interesting mix of beauty and subject matter that can be hard to stomach.  I''m betting a lot of voters had trouble getting past that.  A photo as technically well done as this should of scored much higher.</td>', 'What a interesting mix of beauty and subject matter that can be hard to stomach.  I''m betting a lot of voters had trouble getting past that.  A photo as technically well done as this should of scored much higher.', '2006-03-26 13:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
