(2260746, 302986, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9.  Excellent opportunity capture.  Conjures a variety of mixed ''thoughts'' but the bottom line is: it''s genuine and captures reality.  The pipe? - didn''t bother me too much, in fact added a ''back alley'' type feel to the shot in my opinion.  Without it, still good, but not the same feel.  The square framing was excellent and composition near perfect.  A ''once off'' shot.  Taking the liberty of adding to my Favorites.  Colors are also complementary and even more ironic, is where this was taken.</td>', 'I gave this a 9.  Excellent opportunity capture.  Conjures a variety of mixed ''thoughts'' but the bottom line is: it''s genuine and captures reality.  The pipe? - didn''t bother me too much, in fact added a ''back alley'' type feel to the shot in my opinion.  Without it, still good, but not the same feel.  The square framing was excellent and composition near perfect.  A ''once off'' shot.  Taking the liberty of adding to my Favorites.  Colors are also complementary and even more ironic, is where this was taken.', '2006-03-26 19:58:20.000000', NULL, 0),
