(2287934, 303248, 37893, '<td valign="top">This is a unique perspective IMHO. The stem gets OOF towards the left but the sharpness is still there for the rest of the flower. The punch by using a black background really makes this image stand out.</td>', 'This is a unique perspective IMHO. The stem gets OOF towards the left but the sharpness is still there for the rest of the flower. The punch by using a black background really makes this image stand out.', '2006-04-05 00:30:24.000000', NULL, 0),
