(2300674, 303550, 48890, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by saiphfire:</b></div><hr/><i> I''d have preferred a bit more depth of field here - nothing really seems to be in focus </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Most of the shot not being in focus is the main idea of this picture.<br/> <br/>To all you lovers of sharpness - try to see more in a photograph than just an object.</td>', 'Originally posted by saiphfire: I''d have preferred a bit more depth of field here - nothing really seems to be in focus  Most of the shot not being in focus is the main idea of this picture. To all you lovers of sharpness - try to see more in a photograph than just an object.', '2006-04-10 02:10:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2304317, 303180, 52957, '<td valign="top">Hello everybody and thanks for your votes and comments. I am rather late with this reply, so I do apologize. Now to the question that most of you asked "IS SHE REAL?" Of couse she is not real! I found here in a corner of a second hand shop and asked the sale assistant whether I could take a picture of her. We found a dress and set here into the right light and then I took the picture. I have to say it was great fun having a model who doesn''t complain and sits still LOL.....</td>', 'Hello everybody and thanks for your votes and comments. I am rather late with this reply, so I do apologize. Now to the question that most of you asked "IS SHE REAL?" Of couse she is not real! I found here in a corner of a second hand shop and asked the sale assistant whether I could take a picture of her. We found a dress and set here into the right light and then I took the picture. I have to say it was great fun having a model who doesn''t complain and sits still LOL.....', '2006-04-11 19:11:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2309341, 303015, 255, '<td valign="top">man, i thought i added this a month ago. it better stick this time. :) you rock, chica.</td>', 'man, i thought i added this a month ago. it better stick this time. :) you rock, chica.', '2006-04-13 04:00:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2318483, 302733, 23394, '<td valign="top">this type of shot has potential, but i think the editing could use a little work.  maybe you cropped in just a bit too tight?  this probably could have used a simple black border, as well.  focus is a little soft, could have used a little usm.<br/> <br/>ok, you''ve got a killer camera, and yes, it does have a learning curve.  and, it also puts more responsibility on you to do more work in post-processing.  you have moved very far from shore with this, and it''s a good thing, and you CAN make it a great thing--BUT, it is not automatic.  you are going to have to dig in and work with it.  you have what it takes, but don''t get all wound up because it takes work.  just dig in and do it.</td>', 'this type of shot has potential, but i think the editing could use a little work.  maybe you cropped in just a bit too tight?  this probably could have used a simple black border, as well.  focus is a little soft, could have used a little usm. ok, you''ve got a killer camera, and yes, it does have a learning curve.  and, it also puts more responsibility on you to do more work in post-processing.  you have moved very far from shore with this, and it''s a good thing, and you CAN make it a great thing--BUT, it is not automatic.  you are going to have to dig in and work with it.  you have what it takes, but don''t get all wound up because it takes work.  just dig in and do it.', '2006-04-17 10:12:37.000000', NULL, 0),
