(2353840, 303445, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and lighting.  Even the artifacts add something.  I voted pretty low on this image - but on second looks I would have given it a higher grade.  It''s all too easy to vote high marks for images that leap into ones eyes.  But ones which have some sort of subtle rendition get overlooked.  I must improve my voting skills...</td>', 'I like the pose and lighting.  Even the artifacts add something.  I voted pretty low on this image - but on second looks I would have given it a higher grade.  It''s all too easy to vote high marks for images that leap into ones eyes.  But ones which have some sort of subtle rendition get overlooked.  I must improve my voting skills...', '2006-04-28 16:51:43.000000', NULL, 0),
