(2383414, 303248, 49652, '<td valign="top">I love this picture and everytime I see your name "Tuckersmom" I think of this picture.  I like the texture, the color and the single drop.  So now, after looking at this many times, I am just going to add it to my favorites.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-04 21:17:00.</i></td>', 'I love this picture and everytime I see your name "Tuckersmom" I think of this picture.  I like the texture, the color and the single drop.  So now, after looking at this many times, I am just going to add it to my favorites.', '2006-05-04 22:14:44.000000', '2006-05-04 22:17:00.000000', 0),
